;#############################################################################################################
;# NormalSpriteIDs.asm -- Regular sprite IDs (the 24-slot table).
;#
;# See also (sibling reference files):
;#   ys_enmy.asm + ys_enmy2.asm..ys_enmy14.asm -- per-sprite Init/Main handler bodies
;#                                                (15 files split by subsystem; the framework's
;#                                                Init/Main bank pointers below correspond to
;#                                                routines distributed across this family)
;#   ys_boss1.asm, ys_boss2.asm                 -- boss handlers (Raphael, Tap-Tap, Naval Piranha,
;#                                                Hookbill, Burt, Salvo, Prince Froggy, etc.)
;#   ys_bbbros.asm                              -- Kamek / boss-brother attack sprites
;#                                                (e.g. AttackingAndEndingKamek, MagicShootingKamek)
;#   ys_koopa.asm                               -- koopa-family sprites (naked/red/green koopa,
;#                                                parakoopa, koopa shells)
;#   ys_dorobo.asm                              -- Bandit family ("dorobou" = thief; Bandit,
;#                                                RedCoinBandit, hiding Bandits, train Bandit, etc.)
;#   ys_chr.asm                                 -- character/Baby Mario/Baby Luigi cutscene actors
;#############################################################################################################

!Define_YI_NorSpr000_LavaLog = $0000	; Init Bank02:10899; Main Bank02:10927 | Lava Log: bobbing log on lava (W3/W6). Init zeroes $7400, sets float-state $7863=$FF; Main lazy-inits then runs bob loop via DATA_02E1FC + period table DATA_02E258. See docs/family-hazards.md §3.
!Define_YI_NorSpr001_ClosedDoor = $0001	; Init Bank02:3500; Main Bank02:3744 | Closed Door variant: shared with $012/$04E/$093/$0CA/$131. Init at $02A0E7 sets $18=3, snaps to Yoshi in GameMode $0D, falls into init_door. Shared Main opens + triggers screen-exit. See docs/family-misc.md §1.
!Define_YI_NorSpr002_NavalPiranhaVines = $0002	; Init Bank02:13791; Main Bank02:13807 | Naval Piranha Vines: stalk that emerges/retracts during boss fight. Init no-op. Main mirrors boss anim byte, dispatches 7-entry DATA_naval_pir_vine_state_ptr keyed by global stalk-depth $7019D6. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr003_CrateWithKey = $0003	; Init Bank0D:1902; Main Bank0D:1955 | Wooden crate (key variant): standard breakable crate that, when stomped, releases a key. Shares main_crate state machine with $10E; Init checks tileset (jungle/3+13) to nudge Y down and selects keyhole-tile collision via $03D400. See docs/family-misc.md §10.
!Define_YI_NorSpr004_HitSuperBabyMarioBlock = $0004	; Init Bank02:4911; Main Bank02:4925 | Hit Super-Baby-Mario Block: bumps to release Super Star. Init seeds upward Y-vel $FD80. Main detects bump, spawns Super Star $01A2 above, drops + despawns when below floor. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr005_IcyWatermelon = $0005	; Init Bank04:71; Main Bank04:104 | Icy thrown-watermelon: shared init/main with regular/fire variants; queries SuperFX collision, bounces on terrain, applies icy freeze tick that spawns chill child sprite ($006) on enemy contact. See docs/family-misc.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr006_WatermelonFreeze = $0006	; Init Bank04:642; Main Bank04:656 | Freeze chill overlay spawned by an icy melon hit; per-frame SuperFX FXCODE_099011 draws crystals, ticks lifespan via $7A96/$7402, freezes the hit enemy (sound $A0) then despawns when timer underflows. See docs/family-misc.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr007_Watermelon = $0007	; Init Bank04:72; Main Bank04:105 | Regular thrown-watermelon: shared init/main with icy/fire ($005/$009); SuperFX terrain query, bounce, head-bonk SFX on contact, kills target enemy via $03B25B and ends with FE00 launch velocity. See docs/family-misc.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr008_FallingRubble = $0008	; Init Bank0D:13413; Main Bank0D:13423 | Falling rubble (Bowser-fight debris): Init bare RTL. Main draws via SuperFX helper, applies gravity, despawns when Y leaves [-$F600 .. +$0700], decrements active-rubble counter $1072 on death. Spawned by $0CF BowserRocks during giant-Bowser quake. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr009_FireWatermelon = $0009	; Init Bank04:73; Main Bank04:106 | Fire thrown-watermelon: shared init/main with icy/regular; on collision spawns ambient flame trail puffs via DATA_04832D/048335 corner table and ambient sprite $213, then ignites target enemy. See docs/family-misc.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr00A_Kaboomba = $000A	; Init Bank03:14585; Main Bank03:14611 | Kaboomba (walking-cannon Koopa). Init seeds aim-cycle ($18,x=7, frame counter from DATA_kaboomba_aim_durations) and XSpeed from variant byte. Main dispatches a 3-state ptr table (aim cycle / fire / cooldown) and fires Yoshi-aimed cannonballs. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr00B_Cannonball = $000B	; Init Bank0E:42; Main Bank0E:63 | Cannonball: ground-rolling/airborne cannon projectile. Shares init body with $060 Bomb (initial cooldown timer + $7F dispatch tag), but uses its own main that handles airborne trajectory before falling through to the Bomb logic; on impact spawns explosion ambient sprite $1ED. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr00C_RaphaelTheRaven = $000C	; Init Bank0F:5575; Main Bank0F:5593 | Raphael the Raven (W6 castle boss). Init delegates to CODE_raphael_seed_init. Main runs two state machines (pre-fight cinematic, combat AI) via DATA_raphael_init_ptr / DATA_raphael_main_ptr, gated by level-mode $09. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr00D_GoalRing = $000D	; Init Bank02:4024; Main Bank02:4111 | Goal Ring: end-of-level hoop. Init draws ring as 3 SEPARATE tilemap chunks via FXCODE_088619 x3 (each call with a different FXDATA source pointer -- $540000+$4010, $550000+$60E0, $540000+$3040 -- not 3 quadrants of one chunk; the "open at bottom-right" is intentional, that's where Yoshi enters). Main runs DETERMINISTIC flower-bonus selection (DATA_02A601 maps flower-count to spin duration; the roulette is frame-manipulable), flower-tally with Thunder Lakitu sounds (DATA_02A60D), level-clear cinematic. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr00E_GOALLetters = $000E	; Init Bank0F:56; Main Bank0F:79 | GOAL banner letter. Init seeds palette mirror with letter colors from DATA_5FCC10 and sets phase=5 in $18. Main dispatches 4 phase routines (rise/settle/idle/sparkle) and kicks FXCODE_09ACDA. **Single sprite slot renders all 4 letters** (G/O/A/L) via FXCODE_09ACDA reading 4 control bytes (R5/R6/R9/R10) -- not 4 separate slots, not a multi-slot batch. $18,x is the letter-phase countdown (0..5). See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr00F_BonusChallengeSign = $000F	; Init Bank0F:246; Main Bank0F:282 | BONUS / BONUS CHALLENGE sign. Init centers position (Layer1 + $80, -$40), seeds palette at $702F2E, queues SoundID95. Main animates via FXCODE_09AE83 + 4-entry phase dispatch. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr010_RoundedCagedGhost = $0010	; Init Bank06:10965; Main Bank06:10986 | Rounded Caged Ghost: Boo trapped in a round cage that spits Shy Guys. 5-entry DATA_caged_ghost_round_state_ptr; facing tracks player X. Egg-hit frees the Boo. See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr011_ItemCard = $0011	; Init Bank11:8220; Main Bank11:8312 | Item card (post-level pick-a-prize). Init copies $1C bytes of per-card prize graphics into SuperFX scratch via DATA_11C8D8 lookup, kicks off FXCODE_089BE1 to render the spinning card. Main state-machines through intro spin / award / exit. Prize is DETERMINISTIC: ($1170 - $03) + $0A = 1/2/3 extra lives indexed by sub-mode (not RNG); the "spin" is one revolution of the card-face anim. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr012_BossDoor = $0012	; Init Bank02:3526; Main Bank02:3745 | Boss Door: door family member ($001/$04E/$093/$0CA/$131). Init falls into shared init_door (FXDATA_550000+$60C0 tilemap). Shared Main opens on contact, fades, triggers boss-room exit. See docs/family-misc.md §1.
!Define_YI_NorSpr013_BossExplosion = $0013	; Init Bank02:10590; Main Bank02:10610 | Boss Explosion VFX: white flash + pop when boss reaches 0 HP. Init plays SoundID $74, arms 2048-tick countdown $7A38. Main cycles colors from DATA_02DF68, hands off to game-mode $31. See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr014_KeyFromBoss = $0014	; Init Bank02:10019; Main Bank02:10058 | Key-from-Boss: giant key dropped after fortress boss dies. Init disables Yoshi input (PlayerState $1A), warps key to Yoshi. Main runs 5-state DATA_key_from_boss_state_ptr cinematic (emerge -> drift -> glow -> insert). See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr015_SubmarineTorpedo = $0015	; Init Bank04:245; Main Bank04:277 | Submarine torpedo: $03AD24 spawn prologue then state-machined search; queries SuperFX FXCODE_098D5E for nearest target, picks one of 8 cardinal velocities from DATA_048153, plays hit-head SFX on collision. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr016_BiggerBoo = $0016	; Init Bank04:6876; Main Bank04:7068 | Bigger Boo (World 2-5 fort boss): 8-state machine (spawn / Kamek-growth pulse / chase / facing-away invincible / hit-recoil / defeat-prep / defeat-fall / clear); $7A98 swap palettes, $76 indexes DATA_bigger_boo_state_ptr. See docs/bossengine.md and docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr017_FrogPirate = $0017	; Init Bank0E:12256; Main Bank0E:12303 | Frog Pirate: large hopping pirate-frog mid-boss (21-state pointer table). Three main-branches by state: <$0D normal physics, $0D-$14 cutscene/eaten-by-tongue path, >=$15 simple animate. Damage by egg-feed (swallow); stomp hands off to head_bop_frog_pirate which animates eating Yoshi and locks Player into cutscene state. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr018_WatermelonFlame = $0018	; Init Bank04:513; Main Bank04:533 | Watermelon flame trail puff spawned by fire-melon impact: inherits parent slot pos via $701902-indexed table, jitters by DATA_04832D/048335 corner offsets, asks SuperFX FXCODE_08867E to draw and ignites touched enemy with FE00 upward. See docs/family-misc.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr019_Bubble = $0019	; Init Bank04:728; Main Bank04:755 | Underwater air bubble: pulses radius/wobble through DATA_0484C1/0484ED/0484FD tables, drifts upward, plays pop SFX ($3B) at end of life or when popped by Yoshi/eggs; can free an enemy it touches. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr01A_SkiLift = $001A	; Init Bank04:967; Main Bank04:1004 | Ski-lift platform: rides a cable per level header; reads $700006 slot byte to pick cable-segment behaviour from DATA_048693 (speed) and DATA_048697 (path); Yoshi can stand on it and is carried. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr01B_VerticalLavaLog = $001B	; Init Bank04:1227; Main Bank04:1254 | Vertical lava log: bobs up and down with capped FF80/0080 speed; widens collision (FFF6) when level header BG1 tileset is lava ($03 or $0D); clears Yoshi's stand-on sentinel when descending. See docs/family-hazards.md §3.
!Define_YI_NorSpr01C_DrFreezegood = $001C	; Init Bank05:9830; Main Bank05:9882 | Snowman ice-shooter; 3-state dispatch (skis ski-lift / skis on ground / hit-stun) spawning a freezing ice projectile that locks Yoshi in place when hit. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr01D_DrFreezegoodOnSkiLift = $001D	; Init Bank04:936; Main Bank04:1005 | Dr. Freezegood riding a ski lift: Init spawns lift-partner ($01C) and chains into ski-lift init; Main shared with $01A. Slot stores rider in $7A38 while lift uses standard slot regs. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr01E_Shyguy = $001E	; Init Bank04:1401; Main Bank04:1495 | Standard shy-guy walker: shared 9-state machine (walk / turn / stunned / airborne / in-mouth / trap-stub / bandit-dispense / pop-out / collide-player) via DATA_shy_guy_state_ptr; palette picked from DP-mod tile grid. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr01F_RotatingDoors = $001F	; Init Bank0F:930; Main Bank0F:1018 | Rotating Doors (Bowser-style spinning divider). Init spawns 8 paired arms in a loop (DATA_0F86E1/$86E6 give per-arm angle + frame), seeds $105C-$1064 spin counters. Main dispatches via 5-entry state ptr. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr020_Bandit = $0020	; Init Bank0E:9410; Main Bank0E:9439 | Bandit: ground-running thief enemy with 13-state pointer table. Walks, chases on player proximity, lunges and steals carried egg/coin from Yoshi via $7D38 hold link, then flees off-screen. Stomp (head_bop_bandit, shared with $05B/$0A3/$0A4) recovers the stolen item. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr021_Bucket = $0021	; Init Bank05:8976; Main Bank05:9522 | Bucket dispenser. Once knocked, dispatches via bucket_main_state_ptr (idle/rolling/award/stub) showing a slot-machine display then dropping its contents. The slot-machine animation is purely cosmetic on the base $021 -- state-2 drop logic never reads the reel value; only carrier variants $122/$123 dispense real payloads. Writes $0CCA=$10 (player "holding bucket" flag) when Yoshi adjacent. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr022_FlashingEgg = $0022	; Init Bank03:7378; Main Bank03:7527 | Flashing-egg projectile. Init runs the palette-cycle helper CODE_03B75E then falls into shared egg-init (despawn-if-generator check via CODE_03D3F8, trail-sparkle queue via CODE_0ED844). Main re-runs CODE_03B75E each frame then enters the shared egg-physics body. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr023_RedEgg = $0023	; Init Bank03:7382; Main Bank03:7531 | Red egg ammunition (thrown by Yoshi via aiming reticle). Shares the common egg Init (generator-guard + sparkle queue) and the shared egg-physics Main (gravity, wall-bounce, hit-scan, explosion-glint spawn). Red flavour grants two red coins on hit. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr024_YellowEgg = $0024	; Init Bank03:7383; Main Bank03:7532 | Yellow egg ammunition (coin-shower variant). Shares common egg Init and the shared egg-physics Main with red/green; behavioural difference is in CODE_player_hit/coin-spawn helpers downstream (yellow drops a coin shower on contact). See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr025_GreenEgg = $0025	; Init Bank03:7393; Main Bank03:7533 | Green egg ammunition (standard projectile, falls through giant-egg init path with no extra setup). Shares the shared egg-physics Main with the red/yellow/giant flavours; vanilla impact behaviour. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr026_BowserFightGiantEgg = $0026	; Init Bank0D:13081; Main Bank0D:13094 | Bowser-fight giant egg: bare Init (RTL); preconfigured by spawner. Main flies via SuperFX projectile path; on impact spawns $091 4-RedToadies or coins/stars, triggers giant-Bowser hit-stagger ($1074 hit-counter, $7B56 flag), reads camera anchors $1068/$106A/$106C. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr027_Key = $0027	; Init Bank02:3356; Main Bank02:3405 | Key: collectible that opens adjacent Locked Door. Init snaps to tile grid, FXCODE_0ACE2F scans for keyhole-tile (Map16 ID $B800) within scan radius and binds to it; if no keyhole found within range, the key becomes a "dead key" (collectible but unlocks nothing). Pairing has no explicit ID linkage -- key + door communicate only via shared item-memory bitmap bit at the cached door-tile coords. See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr028_HuffinPuffin = $0028	; Init Bank0E:4955; Main Bank0E:4976 | Huffin Puffin chick: post-hatch running variant that flies in a boomerang arc when picked-up + thrown. 3-state main (run/jump/land); main computes sine/cosine-driven curving velocity off the throw angle so a thrown chick returns toward Yoshi like a boomerang. Spawned by parent $0F6. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr029_GiantEgg = $0029	; Init Bank03:7394; Main Bank03:7438 | Giant egg (Prince Froggy / Frog Pirate wakeup egg). Init is a no-op RTL. Main runs a swallow-timer at $7AF8,x; when it expires, spawns BabyMario back into the slot via CODE_spawn_sprite, clears freeze flags, restarts music and resumes egg physics via CODE_03B83C. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr02A_RedGiantEgg = $002A	; Init Bank03:7395; Main Bank03:7534 | Red giant egg projectile. Init is the no-op RTL (shared with giant-egg). Main shares the egg-physics body at CODE_03B872 (gravity/bounce/hit-scan) with the smaller eggs; giant-flavour impact spawns extra debris/sound via CODE_player_hit branches. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr02B_GreenGiantEgg = $002B	; Init Bank03:7396; Main Bank03:7535 | Green giant egg projectile (lobbed by Frog Pirate / used in some boss fights). Init is no-op RTL. Main is the shared giant-egg body  uses egg-flavour branch in CODE_03B872 to trigger larger explosion + chain-damage on hit. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr02C_LungeFish = $002C	; Init Bank04:3125; Main Bank04:3159 | Lunge Fish: dock-side jumping eater with 10-state machine (submerged-wait / rise / aim+lunge / airborne-grab / drag-Yoshi-down / pin / kill-Yoshi / splash / sink / cooldown). Grab triggers spike-death player state. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr02D_SalvoTheSlime = $002D	; Init Bank06:322; Main Bank06:565 | Salvo The Slime mini-boss: 8-state Init (spawn/ceiling-drip/bounce-back/grow) + 14-state Main DATA_salvo_main_state_ptr. FXCODE_0B86B6 scales the blob twice/frame; pairs with Eyes ($02E) + Slime Block ($03F). See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr02E_EyesOfSalvoTheSlime = $002E	; Init Bank06:2292; Main Bank06:2306 | Eyes of Salvo The Slime: cosmetic eye sprite spawned by Salvo. Init is RTL. Main blinks via $76,x toggle + tracks player via cos/sin LUTs (Mode7 mult) so pupils follow Yoshi. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr02F_LittleMouserHole = $002F	; Init Bank0C:4332; Main Bank0C:4343 | Little Mouser nest (hole). Init/Main are near-stubs: zeros $7400, standard tick. Acts as static spawner anchor for $033 LittleMouserExitingNest and $032 PeekingLittleMouser. See docs/family-misc.md §4.
!Define_YI_NorSpr030_LittleMouser = $0030	; Init Bank0C:4589; Main Bank0C:4675 | Little Mouser: ground-hopping mouse. State machine via $76 sequence; egg-stealing branch checks adjacent egg sprite ($022-$026) and grabs by setting $7019D8. Spawned by $02F/$032/$033/$1A3 family. See docs/family-misc.md §4.
!Define_YI_NorSpr031_PottedSpikedFunGuy = $0031	; Init Bank04:3740; Main Bank04:3796 | Potted Spiked Fun Guy: spawns hidden inside a Small Pot ($0A1) parent then "emerges and walks"; 2-state dispatch (idle inside pot vs walking); X-speed from DATA_049BA6, despawns when pot dies. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr032_PeekingLittleMouser = $0032	; Init Bank0C:4354; Main Bank0C:4385 | Peeking Little Mouser (in nest). Init splits 2 facing variants from $70E2 bit-4. 2 states (cycle-anim / emerge), with 5-substate emerge: lift / hop / lunge / land / vanish. Pops out then spawns $030. See docs/family-misc.md §4.
!Define_YI_NorSpr033_LittleMouserExitingNest = $0033	; Init Bank0C:5453; Main Bank0C:5517 | Little Mouser exiting nest. Tileset-gated init splits castle vs normal style; runs 8-substate exit choreography (rise/hop/lunge/land/pause/leap/squeak/cleanup) then morphs into $030 on status $08. See docs/family-misc.md §4.
!Define_YI_NorSpr034_RogersPot = $0034	; Init Bank02:545; Main Bank02:608 | Roger's Pot: spawns pre-Roger pot + paired Shy Guy pusher $047 + ghost $035. Loads palette DATA_5FE67E into mirror $61. Main syncs X-speed to ghost slot and runs the push interaction. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr035_RogerThePottedGhost = $0035	; Init Bank02:721; Main Bank02:734 | Roger the Potted Ghost: spawned by Roger's Pot $034. Init empty. Main dispatches DATA_roger_state_ptr, calls FXCODE_0A8390 for collision/draw; on contact plays SpringBounce + applies bounce/knockback. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr036_FallingWall = $0036	; Init Bank02:152; Main Bank02:238 | Falling Wall: BG3 crumbling castle wall (palette flips on tileset $0A). Init programs HDMA $0CB8=$0104 + DATA_falling_wall_palette_pool. Main waits Yoshi-near trigger, then drops via DATA_0281FC/$028200 scroll. See docs/family-hazards.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr037_GrimLeecher = $0037	; Init Bank04:4091; Main Bank04:4118 | Grim Leecher: ghostly enemy that detaches and rides Yoshi; 7-state machine (idle-seek / hop / mounted-drain / dismount / fly-away / settle / cleanup). State 2 drains player slot. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr038_PottedGhostFlame = $0038	; Init Bank02:1413; Main Bank02:1446 | Potted Ghost Flame: small flame spat by Roger $035. Init empty (parent populates). Main bounces along floor using DATA_0290DE +-$0080 X-vel; ends on wall or Yoshi contact. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr039_HorizontalRotatingPlank = $0039	; Init Bank02:1564; Main Bank02:1624 | Horizontal Rotating Plank: BG3 rotating wooden plank. Init programs HDMA $01/$02/$03/$06 for per-scanline rotation, seeds angle $16. Main uses PPU multiply on cosine LUT for Yoshi-vs-plank angle each frame. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr03A_3MiniRavens = $003A	; Init Bank0D:7261; Main Bank0D:7306 | 3-pack Mini Ravens: Init reads $7400 to pick speed pair from DATA_0DB8C2, then spawn-loops two more $003A children at +/- DATA_0DB8C6 X offsets, propagating speed into $7AF6. Shares main_mini_raven with $03B. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr03B_MiniRaven = $003B	; Init Bank0D:7262; Main Bank0D:7307 | Single Mini Raven: same Init as $03A but skips the child-spawn loop (ID check); just sets speed cache $78 from $7400. Main flies fixed path, snaps speeds to canonical values via CODE_0DB989, animates from DATA_0DB9AA/DATA_0DB9BA. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr03C_TapTapTheRedNose = $003C	; Init Bank0F:3705; Main Bank0F:3751 | Tap-Tap the Red Nose boss. Init clears velocity, sets hp=$15, seeds intro timer, fires SoundID42 boss-fanfare in TapTapTheRedNosesFort. Main: 18-state machine; head-bop ($7862,x==$18) routes to state $0E death. See docs/family-taptaps.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr03D_LargeSeesaw = $003D	; Init Bank04:6602; Main Bank04:6635 | Large two-platform seesaw: BG3 sprite + first-spawn guard at $0CB2; rocks based on Yoshi weight via CODE_04AEDF; uses DATA_04AED7 swing limits; plays hit-head SFX at max tilt. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr03E_ThinPlatform = $003E	; Thin platform: dedicated ROUTINE file emitted at $00:878A. Init zeroes facing. Main two-phase: phase 1 mirrors 8 sample-Y values into OAM; phase 2 runs SuperFX FXCODE_0B860A physics if Yoshi on platform, else relaxes. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr03F_SlimeBlock = $003F	; Init Bank06:53; Main Bank06:566 | Slime Block: floor/ceiling tile Salvo oozes onto. Init scans level-data buffer for tile id $0174 and locks sprite to that index in $18,x; falls through into shared ground/wall probe. Main shared with Salvo. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr040_BabyLuigi = $0040	; Init Bank0F:1832; Main Bank0F:1870 | Baby Luigi (intro / Bowser-ending cutscene actor). Init calls CODE_03AE60, seeds palette via CODE_0F8D44, clears state. Main: 2-state machine (waiting / animating), drives Y-arc + FXCODE_088295 sprite render. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr041_Stork = $0041	; Init Bank0F:818; Main Bank0F:839 | Stork (Baby Mario delivery cinematics). Init zeros $7400. Main: 3-state machine (approach / flap-sequence / final-flap) keyed off player X-distance; cycles anim via DATA_0F864F (Y-vel) + DATA_0F8655 (timer). Note: DATA_0F864F's "Y velocity" label is misleading -- it's actually an anim-frame index pair ($02 flap-down, $00 flap-up); the level-mode-9 prologue path has no Y velocity at all (camera scrolls instead). See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr042_VerticalPipeEntrance = $0042	; Init Bank02:8709,Bank02:9853; Main Bank02:9880 | Vertical Pipe Entrance: down-pipe. Init sets contact bit $0008 on $70E2, seeds cooldown. Main waits Yoshi-on-mouth via $7D36, sets FreezeSprites=$06, warps via CODE_02CDB9 (writes $0006 to PipeTransitionType; the $80xx high-byte annotation in SRAM_Player.asm is for horizontal pipes only). See docs/family-pipes-signs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr043_RedGiantShyguy = $0043	; Init Bank02:8710; Main Bank02:8737 | Red Giant Shyguy: stompable mini-boss (paired with green $044). Init clears priority bits, arms hit timer DATA_02CF6E. Main animates walk via DATA_02CF9F, runs swallow cinematic on stomp (status $0008). See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr044_GreenGiantShyguy = $0044	; Main Bank02:8738 | GreenGiantShyguy: Init shared with $042/$043 (Bank02:8755). Mini-boss swallows Yoshi on stomp. Init zeros OAM bits, sets scale $75E2=$0100, facing from $10. Main: status==$0008 swallow-state + stomp anim via DATA_02CF9F. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr045_PrinceFroggy = $0045	; Init Bank02:7799; Main Bank02:7963 | Prince Froggy: World 3-4 fort boss; Yoshi swallowed and fights from stomach. Init snaps Yoshi to PlayerState $0E inside stomach, spawns interior $017, aligns palette E1<-D1. Stomach Acid $13B is the hazard. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr046_BurtTheBashful = $0046	; Init Bank06:2926; Main Bank06:3174 | Burt The Bashful boss (W1-4 pants-sumo): Init loads palette $24, pre-renders body via 4 SuperFX blits (088295/08861B/0884A5/0B86B6). Main runs 3-entry phase + substep + anim ptr dispatch (intro/pants-fall/bounce/defeat). See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr047_ShyguyPushingRoger = $0047	; Init Bank0C:12958; Main Bank0C:13013 | Shy Guy pushing Roger the Potted Ghost. Init spawns paired partner (also $047) at +$40 X, linking via $701978/$701900. 2-state main (push-active / paused); shoves pot anchor $7A36 per direction. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr048_CutsceneKamek = $0048	; Init Bank0C:11764; Main Bank0C:11826 | Cutscene Kamek (boss-foreshadow fly-in). 15-state cinematic: wait / fly-in / hover / mouth-flap / message-box / turn / fly-out + per-boss spell-color + boss-music tables. Freezes Yoshi during sequence. See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr049_ThunderLakituFireBlast1 = $0049	; Init Bank04:9264; Main Bank04:9272 | Thunder-Lakitu fire-blast (phase 1): spawns child blast $004B, plays piranha-munch SFX, despawns once parent dies or X drifts past +/-0x100 from anchor. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr04A_ThunderLakituFireBlast2 = $004A	; Init Bank04:9265; Main Bank04:9331 | Thunder-Lakitu fire-blast child (phase 2): per-frame animation step via DATA_04CACD/DATA_04CADC/DATA_04CAEB to drive frame index + sprite extents + draw priority; despawns at frame 0. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr04B_ThunderLakituFireBlast3 = $004B	; Init Bank04:9266; Main Bank04:9332 | Thunder-Lakitu fire-blast child (phase 3): same handler as $04A but spawned by phase-1 directly; shares the DATA_04CACD frame table; calls $03A858 cull check past frame 4. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr04C_UpsidedownBlowHard = $004C	; Init Bank0E:5406; Main Bank0E:5437 | Upside-down Blow Hard: ceiling-mounted spike plant variant of $0F8; shares init + main + 11-state ptr table with normal Blow Hard. Init only differs in initial X-speed sign (DATA_0EAAC1 indexed by $7400); the main flips OAM priority for the upside-down sprite, otherwise same inhale/hold/exhale/sleep cycle. See docs/family-piranhas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr04D_UnusedSpriteIndex = $004D	; Init Bank02:1782; Main Bank02:1789 | Unused Sprite Slot $04D: empty stubs; both Init and Main are bare RTL. Reserved between LockedDoor $04E and MiddleRing $04F. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr04E_LockedDoor = $004E	; Init Bank02:3474; Main Bank02:3746 | Locked Door: requires Key $027 to open. Init checks key-flag at $03D3F8; if held morphs into ClosedDoor $001 and shifts -16Y. Else morphs into plain Door $093. Shares Main with family. See docs/family-misc.md §1.
!Define_YI_NorSpr04F_MiddleRing = $004F	; Init Bank02:1801; Main Bank02:1817 | Middle Ring: in-level checkpoint. Init seeds $7A36=$20 + $03D406 marker registration. Main draws sparkle (FXCODE_08D3F9), hit-tests Yoshi +-32 X / +-56 Y, arms checkpoint $7400, fires first-midpoint tutorial. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr050_GreyRotatingWoodenBoard = $0050	; Init Bank04:4559; Main Bank04:4585 | Grey rotating wooden BG3 board: pivot-mounted plank, calls BG3-spawn helper $02813E, $7A36 = $0140 rotation period; freezes when global freeze/fuzzy/item flags set; OAM via SuperFX FXCODE_0B8595. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr051_LargeWheel = $0051	; Init Bank04:4782; Main Bank04:4808 | Large wheel: big BG3 cart-wheel platform; drifts horizontally between FFA0/0060 limits (DATA_04A33E); requeues BG3 stripe redraw via FXCODE_08D46A each frame; Yoshi rides the rim. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr052_BalloonPlatform = $0052	; Init Bank05:6876; Main Bank05:6950 | Inflatable balloon ride. Once-only spawn (guarded by !RAM_YI_Level_NorSpr_BalloonGeneratorActiveFlagLo); Yoshi mounts and the balloon shrinks then pops; uses SuperFX for the morph. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr053_KamekSayingOhMy = $0053	; KamekSayingOhMy: dedicated ROUTINE file emitted at $00:85DC. Init is bare RTL. Main pins camera, runs 4-state: wait for camera, blink/talk (frame 4 queues SoundID5B + msgbox $82), launch left on dismissal, despawn. See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr054_UpsideDownPiranhaPlant = $0054	; Init Bank05:4253; Main Bank05:4296 | Wild Piranha Plant (upside-down ceiling variant). Shares 17-state Init/Main with $066; lunges to chomp Yoshi, can grab and chew, then retract; defeat sequence and hit-stun states cover stomp/egg deaths. See docs/family-piranhas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr055_4GreenRotatingPlatforms = $0055	; Init Bank04:8270; Main Bank04:8302 | 4 green rotating platforms cluster (manual rotation): Yoshi push spins the wheel; 4 children orbit a central pivot via FXCODE_0B85D0; rotation rate driven by player input direction $19. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr056_4PinkRotatingPlatforms = $0056	; Init Bank04:8271; Main Bank04:8303 | 4 pink rotating platforms cluster (manual rotation): same as $055 but pink palette + alternate phase ($70E2 bit-4 picks initial $19 = $7F/$80 spin direction). See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr057_SewerGhostWithPlatform = $0057	; Init Bank06:12998; Main Bank06:13028 | Sewer Ghost With Platform: Boo holding rideable platform, sewer BG variant. Init seeds platform anchor + bob state. Main runs FXCODE_08E800 mask blit + HDMA/color-math; graphics/bob differ from fort variant $0D6. See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr058_GreenToady = $0058	; Init Bank0E:11588; Main Bank0E:11638 | Green Toady: Kamek's flying winged-minion (the abduct-Baby-Mario enforcers). Shares 6-state main with $05C. Patrols, on proximity to mountless Baby Mario grabs him and carries him off (sets ItemBeingUsed flags); stompable, killable. Green variant is the standard. See docs/family-misc.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr059_StationarySuperStar = $0059	; Init Bank02:2433; Main Bank02:2497 | Stationary Super Star (continuous spawner): tracks player; if not already Super Baby Mario, spawns drawn star and parks pending. Falls into shared Main with $088 -- 2-state pickup/transform table. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr05A_RaphaelSparkAttack = $005A	; Init Bank0F:5408; Main Bank0F:5423 | Raphael Spark Attack (Raphael's projectiles, spawned in volleys of 3). Init = bare RTL. Main animates flicker via DATA_0FABDC and walks radius via DATA_0FABD8 stride; despawns at $FF sentinel. See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr05B_RedCoinBandit = $005B	; Init Bank0E:11242; Main Bank0E:11305 | Red Coin Bandit: bandit that targets a Red Coin instead of carried egg. Init spawns a paired Coin sprite ($115) and links it via $18,x; 7-state main (mostly aliased to base Bandit) drives steal-coin-and-flee. Shares head_bop_bandit with $020/$0A3/$0A4 -- stomp returns the stolen coin. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr05C_PinkToady = $005C	; Init Bank0E:11589; Main Bank0E:11639 | Pink Toady: stronger/faster variant of Green Toady ($058); shares init body and 6-state main_toadies pointer table. Differs only in sprite-ID branch in main (Pink ignores egg-hit immunity that Green has) and in default $74A2 damage table. See docs/family-misc.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr05D_GlitchedSprite = $005D	; Init Bank05:16704; Main Bank05:16706 | Glitched/unused sprite stub. Resolves into bank freespace ($FF padding on V1.0, GarbageData fill on V1.1); placeholder kept only to satisfy the templated SpriteID->Init/Main coverage macros. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr05E_BrownWoodenBoard = $005E	; Init Bank04:4986; Main Bank04:5013 | Brown wooden board (manual swing): cluster shares phase via $0DF7/$0DFB; Yoshi push swings it via CODE_04A280 contact; SuperFX FXCODE_08D486 renders the swinging plank. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr05F_AutoRotateBrownWoodenBoard = $005F	; Init Bank04:4987; Main Bank04:5014 | Brown wooden board (auto-rotate): same cluster framework as $05E but state-01 handler continuously rotates without input; phase synced by $0DF9 active-board count. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr060_Bomb = $0060	; Init Bank0E:43; Main Bank0E:73 | Bomb: stationary fuse-bomb (placed by level / spawned by Banditos). Shares Init with Cannonball ($00B); Main branches: counts down via $16,x cooldown, scans $7860 collision flags, on detonation spawns ambient explosion $1ED at $7CD6/$7CD8 with $0D life. Damages enemies in radius. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr061_BabyMario = $0061	; Init Bank06:6803; Main Bank06:6837 | Baby Mario: Init only stamps OAM-priority flag $C0 into $7863. Main has THREE modes (effectively three sprites in one): on Yoshi -> RideYoshi handler; off-Yoshi normal -> 15-entry DATA_baby_mario_main_state_ptr (cry timer, Kamek bubble, re-mount); off-Yoshi prologue (LevelHeaderLevelMode == $0009) -> separate 5-state machine DATA_baby_mario_levelmode9_state_ptr at $06:CA23 for the stork-dangling sequence. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr062_Goomba = $0062	; Init Bank0C:474; Main Bank0C:485 | Goomba: walk + gravity + turn-on-wall. 6-state main (walk/turn/fall/squashed/kicked/despawn) with frame timers + per-direction speeds from DATA_0C83DB. Stomp produces squish-anim, kick produces $0C8630 state. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr063_MuddyBuddy = $0063	; Init Bank05:13056; Main Bank05:13083 | Mud-throwing floating enemy (5-4 mountable). 10-state dispatch (idle/charge/throw/recover/hit/defeat) with SuperFX-driven aiming at Yoshi; spits a mud-splat projectile that can blind the screen. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr064_4AutoRotatingPinkPlatforms = $0064	; Init Bank04:8258; Main Bank04:8304 | Pink Pinwheel (the canonical name) -- a pinwheel of 4 auto-rotating pink platforms; standalone variant of the 4-platform cluster (no shyguy riders); always spins, $19 byte holds rotation rate from DATA_04C242. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr065_RedCoin = $0065	; Init Bank0C:13537; Main Bank0C:13575 | Red coin: identical to floating coin but with red palette + hidden-item flag offset. Main awaits collision with egg/seed/watermelon-seed IDs ($022-$02B, $107) then spawns $1E4 pop ambient + score via CODE_03B35B. Pickup auto-bumps regular coin counter via fall-through CODE_03A4E9 -> CODE_03A520; the 20th red coin's sound ID gets a magic INC to SoundID94 (not defined in SoundIDs.asm -- open question). See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr066_PiranhaPlant = $0066	; Init Bank05:4254; Main Bank05:4297 | Wild Piranha Plant (upright ground variant). Shares 17-state state ptr with $054; idle->emerge->chomp->grab Yoshi->chew->eject->retract->defeat-fall; raises $7D96 hit flag on egg-strike. See docs/family-piranhas.md.
