!Define_YI_NorSpr067_RockRevealedHiddenWingedCloud = $0067	; Init Bank0F:2002; Main Bank0F:2051 | Hidden Winged Cloud (revealed by ground-pounding a rock). Init dedupes via GenericTable701900. Main: FXCODE_099011 collide-test vs ChompRock/Snowball, then despawns and spawns one of 4 winged-cloud rewards (DATA_0F8EA6). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr068_FlashingEggBlock = $0068	; Init Bank05:204; Main Bank05:236 | Flashing Egg Block. 2-state hop/landed cycle via DATA_egg_block_state_ptr; flashing variant runs an extra palette-flash tick (CODE_03B75E); becomes the active egg in Yoshi's inventory on touch. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr069_RedEggBlock = $0069	; Init Bank05:205; Main Bank05:240 | Red Egg Block. Same 2-state hop/landed cycle as $068, with a per-ID offset stamped into $18,x; supplies the red egg type when Yoshi picks one up. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr06A_YellowEggBlock = $006A	; Init Bank05:206; Main Bank05:241 | Yellow Egg Block. Same shared hop/landed dispatch as $068/$069; only differs by ID-derived $18,x palette offset; yields the yellow-egg type on collect. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr06B_GreenEggBlock = $006B	; Init Bank05:16510; Main Bank05:16543 | Post-hit green-egg block aftermath: ballistic bounce that lands then converts back to a Map16 tile via CODE_change_map16; spawns the egg-flash effect and despawns on landing. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr06C_LargeSpringBall = $006C	; Init Bank05:481; Main Bank05:550 | Large variant of the spring ball; bigger 4-tile bbox + uses CODE_02A007 platform setup. Compresses when Yoshi lands and launches him higher than the small spring ball. See docs/family-misc.md §11.
!Define_YI_NorSpr06D_ClockwiseHootieTheBlueFish = $006D	; Init Bank0D:6531; Main Bank0D:6559 | Hootie the Blue Fish (clockwise): Init sets $7A38 angle=$100, calls shared CODE_03AE60, enables $18,x interact flag, sets radius $7A36=$80, runs shared main_hootie. Travels in CW circle, switches into stomp state $76=6 when bopped. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr06E_CounterclockwiseHootieTheBlueFish = $006E	; Init Bank0D:6521; Main Bank0D:6560 | Hootie the Blue Fish (counter-clockwise): identical Init to $06D but presets $79,x=$0A (CCW palette/direction flag) instead of starting angle. Shares main_hootie; runs CCW around the same circle pattern. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr06F_SpringBall = $006F	; Init Bank05:517; Main Bank05:545 | Standard spring ball platform. Compresses on landing then launches Yoshi upward; shared Main body with the two large variants; light variant skips the gravity helper. See docs/family-misc.md §11.
!Define_YI_NorSpr070_Clawdaddy = $0070	; Init Bank05:950; Main Bank05:985 | Side-walking crab; 5-state cycle walk->raise-claw->swipe-arc (spawns bubble projectile)->scissor open/shut->tremble/recover; claw-segment OAM overlay drives the wind-up/swipe frames. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr071_BigBoo = $0071	; Init Bank0C:11023; Main Bank0C:11077 | Big Boo: large boo with 13-segment trailing body. Init picks one of 7 visible bits from $0CC4 flag-bank. Main runs 3 facing sub-states (advance/cover/pause) using SuperFX angle math (FXCODE_09907C) to home in on Yoshi. See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr072_TrainBandit = $0072	; Init Bank0C:14363; Main Bank0C:14386 | Train Bandit (chalk Shy Guy attacking train-Yoshi). Init seeds anim. Main only active when player is form $08 Train + flag $6180; uses FXCODE_0AE9AE against $0CF19C chalk-stamp table, deflecting velocity per intersection. See docs/family-bandits.md. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr073_BalloonPump = $0073	; Init Bank0C:14119; Main Bank0C:14155 | Balloon Pump (red BG3 balloon pumper). Init spawns paired $1B0 InflatingBG3Balloon at +$10,+$04, tracks partner slot via $78,x. 3-state main (idle/pumping/cleanup); pumps fill level $701976 (caps $0100, escalates while Yoshi stands on). See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr074_Spike = $0074	; Init Bank04:9560; Main Bank04:9585 | Spike (the rolling-ball enemy): 4-state machine (walk-and-spit / post-spit wait / rolling-ball subspawn / stunned); periodically spawns spike-ball child ($075) with FE9A upward Y velocity + horizontal aim. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr075_SpikeBall = $0075	; Init Bank04:9791; Main Bank04:9808 | Spike ball: 5-state machine (launch-arc / roll-along / bounce / post-collide cleanup / idle-stub); arcs from a parent Spike, rolls on terrain, kills Yoshi on contact via $03A858. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr076_ClockwisePiroDangle = $0076	; Init Bank0D:6056; Main Bank0D:6088 | Piro Dangle (clockwise): Init zeros $7400, sets $701900 flag=1, $7A36=$0100 (initial swing), $7542=$40 (timer), $76=4 (initial swinging state). Shares main_piro_dangle with $077; chained flame head swings on a chain pivot. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr077_CounterclockwisePiroDangle = $0077	; Init Bank0D:6048; Main Bank0D:6089 | Piro Dangle (counter-clockwise): same Init as $076 but presets $79,x=$0A first (CCW direction marker). Flame swings on a chain anchor along a circular arc; lands in shared 5-state piro_dangle state machine via DATA_0DAF68 dispatcher. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr078_RedBulletBillShooter = $0078	; Init Bank05:10720; Main Bank05:10781 | Red Bullet Bill Blaster. Cannon-mouth shooter; 3-state idle/fire/cooldown dispatch; ID offset selects sprite spawned ($07B Red); fire window gated by visibility and Yoshi-side check. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr079_YellowBulletBillShooter = $0079	; Init Bank05:10721; Main Bank05:10782 | Yellow Bullet Bill Blaster. Shared 3-state dispatch; ID offset spawns $07C Yellow bouncing variant; uses SuperFX visibility probe to decide when to fire. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr07A_GreenBulletBillShooter = $007A	; Init Bank05:10722; Main Bank05:10783 | Green Bullet Bill Blaster. Shared 3-state dispatch; ID offset spawns $07D Green tracking variant; runs an extra SuperFX line-of-sight test on Init to pick an active fire mode. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr07B_RedBulletBill = $007B	; Init Bank05:11291; Main Bank05:11301 | Red biting Bullet Bill. Charges horizontally, briefly opens jaws to bite/swallow Yoshi (timer $16,x); dies to egg/jump; cooldown returns shooter to inactive state. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr07C_YellowBulletBill  = $007C	; Init Bank05:11617; Main Bank05:11632 | Yellow bouncing Bullet Bill. 4-state dispatch (launch/mid-air bounce/landing/wait); arcs off the ground using SuperFX SIN/COS scaling on $7A36 zoom. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr07D_GreenBulletBill  = $007D	; Init Bank05:11295; Main Bank05:11368 | Green tracking Bullet Bill. Adjusts Y to follow Yoshi mid-flight; constant 4-frame palette cycle; no state machine, single Main loop that nudges Y-speed toward player. See docs/family-cannons.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr07E_DentOfSquishyPlatform = $007E	; Init Bank02:2065; Main Bank02:2076 | Dent-of-Squishy-Platform: invisible tracker for BG3 castella/slime block. Init falls into Main; computes dent depth from Yoshi-vs-block delta Y, drives SuperFX redraw, plays HeadStuck sound on full sink. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr07F_LogSeesawPlatform = $007F	; Init Bank04:6034; Main Bank04:6051 | Log seesaw platform: log on a pivot; tips toward Yoshi side via CODE_04AEDF; DATA_04ACCF picks lean-direction velocity; CODE_04AF4D applies pivot transform to player + plank OAM. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr080_StraightLavaBubble = $0080	; Init Bank05:1800; Main Bank05:1824 | Straight Lava Bubble. Pops out of lava straight up using $7720 launch timer; 2-state in-flight/sinking dispatch; spawns $1D6 splash ambient on apex. See docs/family-hazards.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr081_FollowingLavaBubble = $0081	; Init Bank05:1986; Main Bank05:1825 | Lava Bubble (arcing/tracking variant). 6-state dispatch (rest/rise/apex/descend/splash/cooldown) with horizontal velocity selected to home on Yoshi; same lava splash spawn. See docs/family-hazards.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr082_ChainChomp = $0082	; Init Bank05:2415; Main Bank05:2457 | Chain Chomp. Anchored 4-segment chain; 6-state bite cycle (idle/wind-up/snap-shut/chain-retract/lunge-arc/recoil); rumble jitter applied to chain OAM when airborne; egg-shot routes through hit-stun. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr083_BowserFightCloud = $0083	; Init Bank04:11428; Main Bank04:11441 | Bowser-fight cloud: scrolling cloud platform under Yoshi during the final fight; drifts at DATA_04DB23 (0x30/0x40/0x50/0x60) per RNG-low-bits across the boss arena; $74A1 = 2 priority. See docs/family-clouds.md. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr084_TeleportSprite = $0084	; Init Bank02:3996; Main Bank02:4003 | Teleport Sprite: invisible warp trigger. Init empty. Main checks $7D36 for Yoshi contact + PlayerForm $00, triggers screen-exit per level header. Shares CODE_02A4B5 with door/pipe family -- screen-exit index $038E is derived from Yoshi's position at exit, NOT the teleport-sprite's position. See docs/family-pipes-signs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr085_HarryHedgehog = $0085	; Init Bank01:4627; Main Bank01:4638 | Harry Hedgehog: spiky rolling hedgehog. Init is a bare RTL. Main is a 2-state machine via DATA_01AAE8 (walking / rolling-curled): housekeeping, state dispatch, SuperFX OAM build, hit-flash on stomp. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr086_GlitchedSprite = $0086	; Init Bank05:16705; Main Bank05:16707 | Glitched/unused sprite stub (shares the $05D handler). Resolves into bank freespace padding; placeholder for the templated SpriteID->Init/Main pointer table. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr087_MockUpLaidEgg = $0087	; Init Bank0F:2295; Main Bank0F:2305 | Mock-Up Laid Egg (decorative red 1-up egg). Init = bare RTL. Main: 2-state machine; on landing flag clears velocity + pop timer, then spawns 1-up score (CODE_spawn_1up_score) + smoke FX (CODE_04F88E) and despawns. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr088_SuperStar = $0088	; Init Bank02:2451; Main Bank02:2498 | Super Star: powerup that triggers 10s Super Baby Mario form. Init seeds X-vel from DATA_02987C, draws 3-frame star via FXCODE_088619, plays SoundID $30. Shared Main with $059 (2-state pickup/transform). See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr089_HorizontalMovingRedPlatform = $0089	; Init Bank04:5240; Main Bank04:5286 | Horizontal moving red platform: sweeps +/-0x28 around spawn X (limits at $701900/$701902); X-velocity FF90 or 0070 per pixel-Y bit-4; widens collision FFF6 in lava tileset; shared rider-ride code at CODE_04A77C. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr08A_VerticalMovingPinkPlatform = $008A	; Init Bank04:5315; Main Bank04:5344 | Vertical moving pink platform: mirror of $089 on Y axis; sweeps +/-0x40 around spawn Y; same lava-tileset widening; arms $7542 bob timer; shares CODE_04A77C player-stand check. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr08B_MockUp = $008B	; Init Bank03:13417; Main Bank03:13468 | Inflating target balloon for the balloon-bonus mini-game (the "MockUp" sprite-name is misleading -- this is the actual target balloon in the egg-throw "pop the balloons" minigame; Raidenthequick calls it init_inflating_balloon). Init guards against generator spawns, snapshots spawn xy, seeds variant byte from x-low-nibble. Main runs a 5-entry phase ptr table (DATA_inflating_balloon_state_ptr: wait-proximity, range-check, inflate, pop, recover). See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr08B_InflatingBalloon = $008B	; Friendly alias of $08B (above). Same sprite ID; descriptive name preferred over the opaque "MockUp" template. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr08C_YoshiAtGoal = $008C	; Init Bank02:4843; Main Bank02:4856 | Yoshi at Goal: static "Yoshi cheering" sprite during post-goal tally. Init does distance check; Main bounces -- on floor arms Y-vel $FD80 hop, $7A96=$18 cooldown, redraws via FXCODE_088293. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr08D_Flyguy = $008D	; Init Bank03:13932; Main Bank03:13978 | Flyguy: balloon-carrying Shyguy that drops items. Init guards generator-spawn, derives per-variant index (color/payload) from xy low-nibbles into $701901, snapshots spawn xy. Main dispatches via DATA_flyguy_top_state_ptr (alive vs swallowed) and a 5-entry alive sub-state ptr (enter/drift/detect-player/drop-item/leave). See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr08E_BowserRoomKamek = $008E	; Init Bank0D:11568; Main Bank0D:11641 | Bowser-room Kamek (casts the giant-Bowser spell): Init spawns sprite $134 and saves slot in $105E. First visit runs intro cinematic; revisit (BabyBowerHasBeenVisitedBeforeFlag) writes post-transform palettes and jumps Bowser into giant phase. Main runs 10-state DATA_bowser_room_kamek_state_ptrs. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr08F_MonkeySwing = $008F	; Init Bank05:3169; Main Bank05:3189 | Swinging grinders / rotating saw pair. Init seeds 8000h orbit phase + $FE40 radius; Main uses SuperFX SIN/COS (FXCODE_0B950A) to plot two grinders on a rotating arm around the anchor. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr090_DanglingGhost = $0090	; Init Bank06:9277; Main Bank06:9305 | Dangling Ghost: Boo Guys hanging from sewer ceiling on a stretchy filament. Init sets anchor + rest length, picks swing side by player X. Main runs pendulum physics + lunge-at-Yoshi; kidnap sound on contact. See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr091_4RedToadies = $0091	; Init Bank04:10750; Main Bank04:10766 | 4 Red Toadies: ambush quartet that swoops in when star-timer drops below threshold; 5-state machine (idle-watch / descend / lift-Yoshi / carry-off / drop-disperse); kidnaps Baby Mario on grab via $06C09A and triggers game-over sequence. See docs/family-misc.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr092_MelonBug = $0092	; Init Bank05:15896; Main Bank05:15908 | Pill-bug "Melon Bug". 3-state walk/roll-into-ball/post-roll dispatch; balls up when threatened and reflects projectiles; turns at edges and reverses on egg-hit. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr093_Door = $0093	; Init Bank02:3527; Main Bank02:3747 | Door: vanilla room-to-room door (no key, no boss). Falls through to shared door-family Init/Main; uses tilemap FXDATA_540000+$00F1. See docs/family-misc.md §1.
!Define_YI_NorSpr094_ExpandingBlock = $0094	; Init Bank05:3658; Main Bank05:3678 | Expanding ride platform. 4-state idle/expanding/full/contracting; uses SuperFX zoom ($7A36 multiplier) to scale the platform; plays Growth sound when state changes; Yoshi rides it. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr095_BlueCheckeredBlock = $0095	; Init Bank05:3986; Main Bank05:4015 | Blue checkered switchable block. Solid blue or transparent based on the global ! switch state; shares Main with red variant; 4-state dispatch driving horizontal/vertical sweep transitions. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr096_RedCheckeredBlock = $0096	; Init Bank05:3987; Main Bank05:4016 | Red checkered switchable block. Inverse of $095 (solid when blue is air, etc.); shares dispatch and SuperFX morph stamp; toggles in sync via $0EED. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr097_POWBlock = $0097	; Init Bank05:15395; Main Bank05:15419 | POW Block. Touched/egg-hit triggers a screen-wide enemy clear (writes $20 into $61C6 + CODE_0294B4 detonation); 3-state idle/detonate/post-detonate; spawns $1D4 puff effect. **Caps at 3 uses per level** -- $0E25 bumps by 2 per detonation; 4th Init early-exits. Each successive POW is visibly smaller (DATA_05F5A7 = $0100/$00A0/$0060). See docs/family-misc.md §9.
!Define_YI_NorSpr098_EndTransformationBlock = $0098	; Init Bank05:7213; Main Bank05:7271 | End-of-level Yoshi-shaped goal block. Halts the transformation morph and restores normal Yoshi; 3-state (idle stub / dispense / cleanup); spawns $1E6 puff on Init. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr099_SpinyEgg = $0099	; Init Bank0E:6325; Main Bank0E:6339 | Spiny Egg: tossable spiked egg projectile (shares init RTL with the Needlenose family $0A2/$0E5/$0F9/$11D). Main shares with $0E5/$0F9/$11D: idle until stomped/contacted, then spawns explosion ambient ($1DF) and despawns self -- the projectile burst routine actually launches via the $0A2 fireball main. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr09A_SwingingGreenPlatform = $009A	; Init Bank0E:268; Main Bank0E:285 | Green swinging platform (flatbed ferry, green skin). Uses SuperFX rope-arc math (FXCODE_0B8595) to swing 3 OAM segments + the platform tile in a pendulum about its anchor; tracks player carry state via $61B6 lock so Yoshi rides correctly while it swings. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr09B_MaceGuy = $009B	; Init Bank04:10230; Main Bank04:10266 | Mace Guy: walking enemy that spawns child Mace ($09C) attached via $18,x; despawns mace child on death; on stun ($CurrentStatus = $08) reverts to a shy-guy ($01E). See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr09C_Mace = $009C	; Init Bank04:10346; Main Bank04:10360 | Mace child of Mace Guy: 2-state machine (orbit-parent / detached-fly); orbits parent via SuperFX FXCODE_0B86B6 angle math; when parent dies, detaches with FF00 upward velocity and free-flies. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr09D_RedSwitch = $009D	; Init Bank0E:6921; Main Bank0E:6946 | Red POW switch: stompable button (4-state ptr table). State 0 idle, state 1 wait-near-player, state 2 pressed (sets RedSwitchTimer $0280, locks player input, plays SwitchTicking sound), state 3 expire/restore. Reveals hidden coins/red-coin block during timer; ticking sound has 2-stage urgency (SoundID7E -> SoundID7F at $00C0 threshold ~3.2s remaining). See docs/family-misc.md §9.
!Define_YI_NorSpr09E_ChompRock = $009E	; Init Bank0E:8017; Main Bank0E:8055 | Chomp Rock: pushable boulder, no state table -- main does physics directly. Init detects level (drop into Items, Castle level $28) for spawn de-dup. Main = ground/wall collision via SuperFX ACE2F probe, rolling sprite-angle update, push by player contact, plays RollingRock sound on motion. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr09F_PtooiePiranhaPlant = $009F	; Init Bank05:5369; Main Bank05:5400 | Wild Ptooie Piranha. Spits a tracking needle-ball projectile; 4-state dispatch (pace/charge/spit/defeated); SuperFX visibility line check picks aim; ball arcs toward Yoshi. See docs/family-piranhas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A0_Tulip = $00A0	; Init Bank0C:9464; Main Bank0C:9492 | Tulip (egg-spit catcher / item dispenser). 7-state main (closed/open/catch/chew/spit/refuse/despawn); animates lip dimensions; on catch can spit back coin/item/star via star-timer-derived random index. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A1_SmallPot = $00A1	; Init Bank04:3907; Main Bank04:3923 | Small Pot: empty Init - the carryable ceramic pot for Potted Spiked Fun Guy ($031); when stunned shatters via CODE_049DFC releasing the spiked guy; otherwise behaves as normal carry/throw sprite. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A2_ThunderLakituFireball = $00A2	; Init Bank0E:6326; Main Bank0E:6352 | Thunder Lakitu fireball: ball-of-lightning projectile thrown by Cloud Drop's Lakitu. Shares Needlenose-family init (RTL). Own Main: every 4 frames spawns AmbSpr20F lightning-trail, scans $7860 for terrain hit / scans for player contact then dispatches CODE_0EB302 to break into 3 fan-out projectiles ($0049 chunks) + tongue sound. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A3_LeftHidingBandit = $00A3	; Init Bank0E:9389; Main Bank0E:9440 | Left-Hiding Bandit: bandit camouflaged under left-facing cover (cardboard/tree). Shares init body with $0A4 (X-pos offset chosen by sprite-ID parity in DATA_0EC963), then falls through to base Bandit init. Main shared with $020/$0A4 -- enters state $16 hidden, pops out and behaves like Bandit. Shares head_bop with Bandit family. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A4_RightHidingBandit = $00A4	; Init Bank0E:9390; Main Bank0E:9441 | Right-Hiding Bandit: mirror of $0A3 -- right-facing cover. Identical init/main path with opposite X-offset; flag $7400 set so post-emerge behaviour faces right. Shares 13-state main_bandit + head_bop_bandit with $020/$05B/$0A3. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A5_NepEnut = $00A5	; Init Bank02:7230; Main Bank02:7268 | Nep-Enut / Gargantua Blargg: underwater boss (W3-3 main Nep-Enut / W6 Gargantua) -- same code, different palette+tileset. Init captures spawn-tile parity. Main steers home-X (DATA_02BF89), runs rise/snap/retreat state machine. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A6_IncomingChomp = $00A6	; Init Bank0E:519; Main Bank0E:629 | Incoming Chomp (single foreground): the giant Chomp that crashes through the screen toward player. 7-state ptr (perch / charge / launch / fall / impact / ground-pound / land). Main spawns dust-cloud sub-sprite ($0A8 falling variant) on launch; uses SuperFX (FXCODE_088A0F) for the polygon outline. Stomp uses standard sprite engine. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A7_GroupOfIncomingChomps = $00A7	; Init Bank0E:533; Main Bank0E:1531 | Group of Incoming Chomps (flock): 4-Chomp swarm wave. Init uses global counter $0DC2 (1-instance guard) and seeds 7 sub-particles in WRAM table $0DC6-$0DEE. Main runs the same 7-state ptr table per particle, animating each via per-particle XY + frame state machines (CODE_0E8CF6 etc). See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A8_FallingIncomingChomp = $00A8	; Init Bank0E:605; Main Bank0E:630 | Falling Incoming Chomp: the secondary instance spawned by $0A6 during the launch state -- the actual falling chomp projectile body. Init just clears $7042 bit $20. Main shared with $0A6 (DATA_incoming_chomp_state_ptrs) so it picks up at state $05+ ground-impact / shadow / despawn. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0A9_IncomingChompShadow = $00A9	; Init Bank0E:1839; Main Bank0E:1856 | Incoming Chomp ground shadow: the dark oval projected on terrain under a falling Chomp. Init/Main both call CODE_0E8E6B which runs SuperFX FXDATA_548000+$60E0 to render a 4-frame palette-cycling shadow; tracks falling Chomp altitude via $7A36 (0-$01FF) to grow shadow as it nears ground, then transitions to impact dust on contact. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0AA_BackgroundShyguy = $00AA	; BackgroundShyguy: dedicated ROUTINE file emitted at $00:86E9. Init re-anchors coords from BG1 to BG2 space (parallax) and bumps $74A1 layer +2; despawns if camera scrolling. Main walks +/-32px with random turnaround. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0AB_FullEggSpawner = $00AB	; Init Bank02:2661; Main Bank02:2668 | Full Egg Spawner: pre-boss top-up sprite to restore Yoshi's trail to 6 eggs. Init empty. Main spawns sprite $0025 (egg) until $7DF6 (egg-count) >= $0C, plays StompShyGuy sound, then despawns. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0AC_FallingRockArrowAndShadow = $00AC	; Init Bank0D:13455; Main Bank0D:13465 | Falling-rock warning arrow + shadow: telegraphs giant Bowser's rock-drop attack. Init bare RTL. Main flashes arrow via $0030 bit-test, advances $7402 up to $18,x, despawns when $7A96 timer expires. Spawned by giant Baby Bowser AI. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0AD_MessageBox = $00AD	; Init Bank05:11848; Main Bank05:11877 | Hint/Message-Box "?" sprite. 3-state idle/bounce/open-dialog; touching from below sets !RAM_YI_Level_MessageBoxState which dispatches the Bank01 dialog gamemode. Each level has exactly 4 hint slots via 2-bit position-derived variant (X-bit-4 + Y-bit-4<<1); accepts hits from both head-bump and egg-throw. See docs/family-pipes-signs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0AE_HookbillTheKoopa = $00AE	; Init Bank01:76; Main Bank01:570 | Hookbill the Koopa: World 4-8 castle boss. Init dispatches an 8-state pre-fight cinematic (fog, graphics decompress, Kamek arrives, shell grows) and sets sprite-state=2. Main runs the ~50-state combat loop. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0AF_CarMorphBubble = $00AF	; Init Bank03:8652; Main Bank03:8838 | Car Morph Bubble (Yoshi -> car). Init shares init_transform_bubble (lighter cloud-register, no cloud-setup helper). Main is the shared cloud body; pop dispatch routes to CODE_pop_transform_bubble which triggers the car morph cinematic + form-change. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B0_MoleMorphBubble = $00B0	; Init Bank03:8653; Main Bank03:8839 | Mole-Tank Morph Bubble (Yoshi -> drilling mole tank). Same init_transform_bubble Init and shared cloud Main; CODE_pop_transform_bubble dispatch with sprite-ID offset selects the mole morph (FXDATA_550000+$6071 SuperFX glyph). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B1_HelicopterMorphBubble = $00B1	; Init Bank03:8654; Main Bank03:8840 | Helicopter Morph Bubble (Yoshi -> helicopter). Same init_transform_bubble path; pop selects helicopter glyph (FXDATA_550000+$7061) and invokes the morph cinematic. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B2_TrainMorphBubble = $00B2	; Init Bank03:8655; Main Bank03:8841 | Train Morph Bubble (Yoshi -> train). Same init_transform_bubble + shared cloud Main; pop selects the train SuperFX glyph (FXDATA_550000+$7071) and triggers the rail-bound morph form. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B3_FuzzyFart = $00B3	; Init Bank03:2679; Main Bank03:4121 | Fuzzy Fart: the drifting cloud released after Yoshi swallows a Fuzzy. Init is the shared no-op RTL stub. Main (main_fuzzy_wind) waits for freeze flags clear, then on contact with another sprite kills it (via CODE_03B595/CODE_kill_sprite_by_hit_special_cases); self-despawns when $7A96 timer expires. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B4_SubmarineMorphBubble = $00B4	; Init Bank03:8656; Main Bank03:8842 | Submarine Morph Bubble (Yoshi -> submarine). Same init_transform_bubble Init and shared cloud Main; CODE_pop_transform_bubble dispatch picks the submarine glyph (FXDATA_550000+$70F0) and triggers the underwater morph. See docs/family-clouds.md.
