!Define_YI_NorSpr0B5_HiddenWingedCloud = $00B5	; Init Bank03:8543; Main Bank03:8557 | Hidden Winged Cloud: invisible cloud revealed by Egg-Plant / Watermelon contact. Init calls cloud-helper CODE_03D406 then RTLs. Main (main_winged_cloud) scans the slot array for a nearby alive watermelon/freeze flame, when detected pops via CODE_kill_sprite_by_hit_special_cases and spawns one of 4 prize sprites (1up/5stars/red-switch). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B6_WingedCloudWith8Coins = $00B6	; Init Bank03:8633; Main Bank03:8843 | Winged Cloud with 8 Coins. Shares init_winged_cloud_item (cloud-setup + register-cloud helper) and the shared cloud Main; pop dispatch -> CODE_pop_8_coins (spawns 8 ambient coin sparkles in a ring). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B7_WingedCloudWithBubbled1up = $00B7	; Init Bank03:8634; Main Bank03:8844 | Winged Cloud with Bubbled 1-up. Shares init_winged_cloud_item + shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_1up_bubbled (spawns the bubble-trapped 1up that must be caught before it floats away). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B8_WingedCloudWithFlower = $00B8	; Init Bank03:8635; Main Bank03:8845 | Winged Cloud with Flower. Shares init_winged_cloud_item + shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_flower (spawns a flower power-up which adds to the level's flower-collected count). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0B9_WingedCloudWithPOW = $00B9	; Init Bank03:8687; Main Bank03:8846 | Winged Cloud with POW. Uses init_winged_cloud_B (register-cloud only, no cloud-setup helper); shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_pow (POW-block effect: kills all on-screen enemies). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0BA_WingedCloudWithStairs = $00BA	; Init Bank03:8688; Main Bank03:8847 | Winged Cloud with Stairs. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_stairs (spawns the climbable staircase tilemap structure). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0BB_WingedCloudWithPlatform = $00BB	; Init Bank03:8689; Main Bank03:8848 | Winged Cloud with Platform. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_stairs (same routine as $0BA stairs  spawns the small floating platform variant via internal subtype). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0BC_WingedCloudWithBandit = $00BC	; Init Bank03:8690; Main Bank03:8849 | Winged Cloud with Bandit. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_bandit (spawns a coin-stealing red Bandit enemy). See docs/family-bandits.md. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0BD_WingedCloudWithCoin = $00BD	; Init Bank03:8636; Main Bank03:8850 | Winged Cloud with Coin. Shares init_winged_cloud_item + shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_one_coin (spawns one ordinary coin). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0BE_WingedCloudWith1up = $00BE	; Init Bank03:8673; Main Bank03:8851 | Winged Cloud with 1-up. Has its own init_winged_cloud_1up Init (per-axis position-snap not shared with other clouds); shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_1up (spawns a free-floating 1up mushroom). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0BF_WingedCloudWithKey = $00BF	; Init Bank03:8637; Main Bank03:8852 | Winged Cloud with Key. Shares init_winged_cloud_item + shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_key (spawns the locked-door key sprite NorSpr027). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C0_WingedCloudWith3Stars = $00C0	; Init Bank03:8638; Main Bank03:8853 | Winged Cloud with 3 Stars. Shares init_winged_cloud_item + shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_3_stars (spawns 3 small star ambient sprites that add to the star count). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C1_WingedCloudWith5Stars = $00C1	; Init Bank03:8639; Main Bank03:8854 | Winged Cloud with 5 Stars. Shares init_winged_cloud_item + shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_5_stars (spawns 5 small stars). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C2_WingedCloudWithDoor = $00C2	; Init Bank03:8691; Main Bank03:8855 | Winged Cloud with Door. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_door (spawns a normal-door sprite NorSpr04E for level routing). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C3_WingedCloudWithLowerGround = $00C3	; Init Bank03:8692; Main Bank03:8856 | Winged Cloud with Lower-Ground. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_ground_eater (triggers the "ground eats downward" effect to expose a hidden cavity beneath). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C4_WingedCloudWithWatermelon = $00C4	; Init Bank03:8693; Main Bank03:8857 | Winged Cloud with Watermelon. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_watermelon (spawns NorSpr007 normal seed-spitting watermelon). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C5_WingedCloudWithFireWatermelon = $00C5	; Init Bank03:8694; Main Bank03:8858 | Winged Cloud with Fire Watermelon. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_watermelon (same routine  selects fire variant NorSpr009 via internal sprite-ID offset). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C6_WingedCloudWithIcyWatermelon = $00C6	; Init Bank03:8695; Main Bank03:8859 | Winged Cloud with Icy Watermelon. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_watermelon (selects ice variant NorSpr005 via sprite-ID offset). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C7_WingedCloudWith3LeafSunflower = $00C7	; Init Bank03:8696; Main Bank03:8860 | Winged Cloud with 3-Leaf Sunflower. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_flower_vine (spawns a vine with sunflower leaves to climb). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C8_WingedCloudWith6LeafSunflower = $00C8	; Init Bank03:8697; Main Bank03:8861 | Winged Cloud with 6-Leaf Sunflower. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_flower_vine (same routine  picks 6-leaf height variant via internal byte). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0C9_WingedCloudWithCrashGameFeature = $00C9	; Init Bank03:8698; Main Bank03:8862 | Winged Cloud with Crash-Game Feature. Uses init_winged_cloud_B; shared cloud Main; pop ptr is $0000 (no payload spawn  name "CrashGameFeature" reflects upstream notes that this slot historically locked the game; no-op in V1.0/V1.1). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0CA_BigBossDoor = $00CA	; Init Bank02:3458; Main Bank02:3748 | Big Boss Door (Bowser): Init runs boss-door tilemap (DATA_02A9CE), seeds $7BB6/$7BB8=$1C/$39 hitbox, FXDATA_550000+$60C0 + FXCODE_09F897 secondary draw. Shares Main with door family. See docs/family-misc.md §1.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0CB_WingedCloudWithCoinOrStar = $00CB	; Init Bank03:8701; Main Bank03:8863 | Winged Cloud with Coin-Or-Star (random). Init is just the inline pop helper at CODE_03C1C4 (skips both cloud-setup and register-cloud); shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_random_item (RNG-selects coin / star / 1up payload). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0CC_WingedCloudWithRedSwitch = $00CC	; Init Bank03:8640; Main Bank03:8864 | Winged Cloud with Red Switch. Shares init_winged_cloud_item + shared cloud Main; pop -> CODE_pop_switch (spawns the red ! switch that toggles red-? blocks). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0CD_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingGiantEgg = $00CD	; Init Bank07:14061; Main Bank07:14205 | Giant-egg Baron Von Zeppelin variant: balloon enemy that drifts horizontally then drops a giant egg payload onto Yoshi. Shares the BVZ payload-drop Main; pop releases the egg sprite. See docs/family-eggs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0CE_BowserFire = $00CE	; Init Bank0D:13308; Main Bank0D:13352 | Bowser's fire-breath projectile: Init sets hitbox $74A2=$07, lifetime $7402=$08, runs SuperFX fireball-render helper (FXCODE_0888AC). Main scrolls forward, advances $7A36/$7A38 angle accumulator and applies XY drift; despawns off-screen. Spawned by giant Baby Bowser. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0CF_BowserRocks = $00CF	; Init Bank0D:12758; Main Bank0D:12849 | Bowser-fight quake / falling rocks: Init batch-renders 3 rock graphics via FXCODE_088205 loop, copies palette-pulse table DATA_5FF4A0, seeds rubble counter $18,x=$1C/$3C. Main plays BigExplosion SFX, spawns $008 FallingRubble waves at staggered intervals, drives $61C6 quake amplitude. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D0_HorizontalEntranceToRight = $00D0	; Init Bank02:9927; Main Bank02:9958 | Horizontal Entrance (rightward): pipe-entrance facing right. Init shared with left variant -- FXCODE_0ACE2F registers hitbox; $7400 stores facing. Main detects D-pad-right + Yoshi-on-mouth, freezes sprites, warps. Writes $8002 to PipeTransitionType (high bit signals horizontal). See docs/family-pipes-signs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D1_SecretPipeEntrance = $00D1	; Init Bank02:9854; Main Bank02:9870 | Secret Pipe Entrance: hidden pipe (sniff-cooldown gated). Init shares with $042 -- contact bit + cooldown. Main first runs CODE_02D985 (sniff radius $02); only enters if sniff-detect carry-set before falling through. Spawns AmbSpr $224 sparkle on sniff-detect (NOT horizontal pipes -- the AmbSpr label "Horizontal-pipe-entrance warp sparkle" is inaccurate). See docs/family-pipes-signs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D2_MarchingMilde = $00D2	; Init Bank06:5118; Main Bank06:5169 | Marching Milde boss (W4-4 rolling pink): Init spawns sub-sprite via CODE_03A366, mirrors pos, loads palette $2A. Main is 8-entry phase JMP on boss-phase word $105C (roll-march, jump, split into mini-Mildes, defeat). See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D3_LargeMilde = $00D3	; Init Bank0F:2688; Main Bank0F:2709 | Giant Milde (large purple blob; Marching Milde split product). Init: CODE_03ADD0 alloc + seeds render-scale $0100 in slot tables. Main+StompRt aliased; walks/hops via $76,x machine; stomp splits into Medium Mildes ($0D4) via shared StompRt. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D4_MediumMilde = $00D4	; Init Bank0F:3314; Main Bank0F:3325 | Medium Milde (left after Giant Milde split). Init = bare RTL (parent seeds slot). Main+StompRt aliased; 4-state inner machine (walk/turn/squash/separate) via DATA_0F9943; further stomp triggers final dissolve. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D5_BackgroundForHookbillFight = $00D5	; Init Bank02:2749; Main Bank02:2765 | Background-for-Hookbill-Fight: BG3 platform sprite that paints under Hookbill in the boss room. Init empty (BG pre-loaded). Main programs FXCODE_089183 each frame for curved/scrolling BG; state != 0 switches to FXCODE_08E167 cracking-floor (used in defeat sequence). See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D6_FortGhostWithPlatform = $00D6	; Init Bank06:11565; Main Bank06:11587 | Fort Ghost With Platform: Boo holding rideable platform, fort/castle BG variant of $057. Init seeds state + sets bit $8000 of gen-tbl-701902. Main runs FXCODE_0ACE2F mask + collision probe. See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D7_SluggyTheUnshaven = $00D7	; Init Bank02:8948; Main Bank02:8995 | Sluggy the Unshaven: W2-4 castle slime boss (slime-on-springboard). Init copies palette DATA_02D109 to CGRAM, primes body-scale. Main builds 7 body segments via FXCODE_0A8390, dispatches DATA_sluggy_state_ptr; egg-hits push eggs back. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D8_ChompWarningSign = $00D8	; Init Bank02:2887; Main Bank02:2915 | Chomp Warning Signboard: "!" sign telegraphing Chomp danger zones. Init draws static tilemap via FXCODE_088293 from FXDATA_548000+$00C1. Main just JMLs shared sprite housekeeping CODE_03AA52 -- no per-frame logic. See docs/family-pipes-signs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0D9_FishinLakitu = $00D9	; Init Bank0E:14527; Main Bank0E:14560 | Fishin' Lakitu: cloud-riding fisherman who dangles bait on a line. Init sets initial Y-speed + X-direction; in Don't Look Back level uses a special variant ($78=$02). Main scrolls Lakitu via 6-state ptr, dispatches the dangle ($011C bait sub-sprite linked via $6162) which Yoshi can eat. Shares head_bop with bandit family via CODE_0ECCC7. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0DA_FlowerPot = $00DA	; Init Bank0D:7598; Main Bank0D:7628 | Flower pot: stationary collectible-spawning prop. Init caches spawn XY in $701900/$701902, runs key-tag check ($03D400), sets stomp box $7BB6=$08/$7BB8=$0C. Main on head-bop ($7D36) launches the pot Y=$FD00 with signed X from DATA_0DBBC9 (4-direction toss). Rideable. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0DB_SoftBlock = $00DB	; Init Bank06:12067; Main Bank06:12091 | Soft Block: squishy deformable terrain. Init picks base size from DATA_06E93C/06E940 by bit $10 of $70E2 (floor vs ceiling). Main runs damped spring physics, writes per-vertex deformation into SuperFX tile-stamp table. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0DC_Snowball = $00DC	; Init Bank0E:9306; Main Bank0E:9326 | Snowball: rolling/grows-as-it-rolls snowball projectile. Init sets initial radius $0598 + sets bounce flag $8001 if level is RideTheSkiLifts. Main physics (gravity, ground collision, growth) plus SuperFX rendering FXCODE_0B9567 + FXDATA_548000+$6080; size grows on roll-distance and plays RollingRock sound. See docs/family-hazards.md §7.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0DD_CloseWallInNavalPiranhaRoom = $00DD	; Init Bank01:3543; Main Bank01:3583 | CloseWallInNavalPiranhaRoom: shared post-boss closer cinematic sprite (used by Naval Piranha, Hookbill, Salvo; Raphael bypasses with on-canvas star-formation). Init is a bare RTL. Main gates on $7A96 timer, dispatches 8-entry DATA_boss_closer_ptr (wait/camera1/camera2/arena/finish/salvo/naval/hookbill states) driven by sequence rows in DATA_01A259; Naval uses rows 0-7, Hookbill uses rows 7-13. See docs/bossengine.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0DE_FallingRockPlatform = $00DE	; Init Bank02:2927; Main Bank02:2974 | Falling Rock Platform: stone slab that drops on Yoshi. Init queries SuperFX tile-collision (FXCODE_0ACD1E) for footprint, seeds hitbox + drop timer $7A96=$70. Main runs drop-then-crumble; shares core with $137-$13A. See docs/family-hazards.md §6.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0DF_PiscatoryPete = $00DF	; Init Bank0C:10115; Main Bank0C:10147 | Piscatory Pete (jumping fish). Init picks left/right variant from $70E2 bit-4. Main per-variant 2 sub-states (underwater / arc); SuperFX FXCODE_09907C computes jump trajectory toward Yoshi. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E0_PreyingMantas = $00E0	; Init Bank0C:10423; Main Bank0C:10452 | Preying Mantas (jellyfish). Init parks Y anchor + 3-step counter from bit-4 position. 2-state main (cruise / surge): cruise alternates rise/fall via $7402 cycle; surge resets when reaching anchor. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E1_LochNestor = $00E1	; Init Bank0C:10538; Main Bank0C:10569 | Loch Nestor (pufferfish). 3-state underwater sub-state (sine-circle drift / approach / dive) + 6-state surfaced emerge sub-state. Inflates ($16=$00A0..$0133) then pops via CODE_04849E + sound $3B. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E2_BooBlah = $00E2	; Init Bank0E:1932; Main Bank0E:2040 | Boo Blah: pulsing ghostly blob enemy. 7-state ptr table (DATA_boo_blah_state_ptrs) driving expand/contract pulse plus hit-by-egg / kill paths. Init picks initial X-speed by $7400 direction and tilemap-aligns position; can be inverted (ceiling-mounted) based on $70E2 bit $10. See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E3_BooBlahWithPiroDangle = $00E3	; Init Bank0E:1933; Main Bank0E:2041 | Boo Blah carrying Piro Dangle: composite variant of $0E2 -- on init spawns a Piro Dangle ($0076) sub-sprite linked via $18,x. Shares init + main + 7-state ptr table with $0E2; main extends the Blah's death path to also despawn the hanging Piro Dangle ($7542/$7040 cleanup on $7019D6 >= 5). See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E4_HeadingCactus = $00E4	; Init Bank05:12711; Main Bank05:12749 | Heading Cactus (charging cactus). Spawns a $0E5 GreenNeedlenose projectile on Init; 6-state idle/wind-up/spit/cooldown/hit/defeat; sight-line ($5B7) gates the spit; world-specific timer (longer in World1). See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E5_GreenNeedlenose = $00E5	; Init Bank0E:6327; Main Bank0E:6340 | Green Needlenose: small spiked porcupine-fish enemy (shoots egg-like spines). Shares family init (RTL) and main with $099/$0F9/$11D. Main scans $7860 collision for player contact (DATA_0EB270 4-pos lookup), spawns ambient $1DF damage burst, dispatches break-into-spines path for the thunder fireball variant only. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E6_Gusty = $00E6	; Init Bank01:4838; Main Bank01:4913 | Gusty: two roles selected by $7182 bit 4. Generator path snaps X to 32px, sets invincibility, increments global Gusty-active flag. Main has float/generator modes; generator spawns one Gusty per $0100 frames. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E7_Burt = $00E7	; Init Bank05:5798; Main Bank05:5915 | Burt the Bashful family. 16-state inflate/deflate/hop/airborne/defeat dispatch shared by small and large Burts; partner-pair Init spawns the second sibling on the opposite side of the room. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E8_Goonie = $00E8	; Init Bank0E:2593; Main Bank0E:2749 | Goonie: black flying bird that swoops on Yoshi (single). 7-state ptr table. Init computes initial flight altitude/speed + reserves a flock-counter slot ($0C7C). Main flies horizontally then dives at player Y; the get-eaten branch (state $05) calls CODE_0DC0F0 to feed Yoshi tongue. See docs/family-goonies.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0E9_3WinglessGoonies = $00E9	; Init Bank0E:2538; Main Bank0E:2750 | 3-Pack Wingless Goonies: spawner+flock parent for 3 flightless Goonies. Init increments $18 then spawns 2 more $0E9 instances with staggered X-offsets (DATA_0E9368 = $10/$20) and shared $7400 direction; runs the Goonie state-ptr table but with no flight (gravity-bound walking flock). See docs/family-goonies.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0EA_VerticalCloudDrop = $00EA	; Init Bank06:6393; Main Bank06:6445 | Vertical Cloud Drop (small gusty enemy): falls or rises by bit $10 of $70E2. Init sets Y-speed FE70 (up) or 0180 (down) + anim from DATA_06B9C2. Main skips on freeze/fuzzy/item-in-use; drifts Y, checks contact. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0EB_HorizontalCloudDrop = $00EB	; Init Bank06:6612; Main Bank06:6662 | Horizontal Cloud Drop: X-axis mirror of $0EA. Init picks dir by bit $10 of $70E2, X-speed FE70/0180, anim from DATA_06BB6A. Main mirrors $0EA on X; StompRt at $06BC9A handles head-bop frames. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0EC_JumpingFlamerGuy = $00EC	; Init Bank05:8204; Main Bank05:8245 | Jumping Flamer Guy. 7-state walk/ignite/flame-on/airborne/land/recover/revert-to-Shyguy dispatch shared with $0ED; jumping variant gets initial -Y velocity (#$FC00) and shorter ground time. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0ED_RunningFlamerGuy = $00ED	; Init Bank05:8205; Main Bank05:8246 | Running Flamer Guy. Shared 7-state dispatch with $0EC; running mode keeps grounded, leaves a fire trail; egg/stomp converts back to a normal Shyguy ($01E) via CODE_spawn_sprite call. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
