!Define_YI_NorSpr0F0_EggoDilPetal = $00F0	; Init Bank05:8136; Main Bank05:8143 | Eggo-Dil orbiting petal. Init is a near-empty stub; Main reads its position from the parent face's slot-table writes (not autonomous physics), despawns when parent face flags dead, pierces Yoshi on touch. See docs/family-misc.md §12.
