!Define_YI_NorSpr0F3_WoozyGuy = $00F3	; Init Bank0C:15533; Main Bank0C:15616 | Woozy Guy: walks dizzy on YI wavy floor. 6-state walk-cycle (4 phases / dizzy / fall). Init has 2 variants (regular vs ceiling via FXCODE_0ACE2F probe). On-hit branches to 2-state knockback (knockback / land) via $701901. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
