!Define_YI_NorSpr0F6_MotherHuffinPuffin = $00F6	; Init Bank0E:4563; Main Bank0E:4630 | Mother Huffin Puffin: parent chicken boss. Init runs SuperFX FXCODE_0991D5 (collision-scan), then spawns up to (R6 - 6) chick sub-sprites ($028) along the scan results with a literal $0008-stride per chick (the spawn-X offset; DATA_0EA786 is the chick's per-frame velocity table, NOT the parent's spawn offsets). 4-state main: idle/lay-eggs/panic/despawn; killable by stomp on parent. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0F7_BarneyBubble = $00F7	; Init Bank0E:4146; Main Bank0E:4164 | Barney Bubble: floating bubble enemy that traps Yoshi on contact. 4-state ptr table (idle bob / drift / pop / despawn). Main uses SuperFX FXCODE_0B86B6 for circular bubble outline; on hit-by-egg state advances to pop ($76=$02). When Yoshi inside (capture lock $61B6), drags player along upward. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0F8_BlowHard = $00F8	; Init Bank0E:5407; Main Bank0E:5438 | Blow Hard: ground spike-plant that inhales then spits projectiles. Shares init + main + 11-state ptr table with $04C upside-down variant. States: dormant / inhale (suck player toward it) / hold / exhale projectile spray / sleep, plus damage/death paths. Sprite-ID branch flips $6FA2 OAM for upright variant. See docs/family-piranhas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0F9_YellowNeedlenose = $00F9	; Init Bank0E:6328; Main Bank0E:6341 | Yellow Needlenose: yellow color variant of $0E5. Shares family init (RTL) + shared main_needlenose_family; sprite-ID-specific branch routes Yellow to the same ambient-spawn path as Green (no break-into-spines path). Differentiated only by graphics/damage. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0FA_Flower = $00FA	; Init Bank0E:6560; Main Bank0E:6604 | Flower: 5-collectible (the bonus flowers). Init opens petals via CODE_03D406/03D40E. 4-state main: bloom -> sway -> collected -> reward. On player contact (state 3 via CODE_0EB4AE) increments FlowersCollectedLo cap-5; 5th flower triggers 1up + bonus item + tutorial message $002D first time. SuperFX-rendered (vs $110 which is OAM-tilemap-rendered); both share CODE_0EB525 collect routine; CODE_pop_flower picks 50/50 between them via RNG (cloud-popped flowers randomly variant). See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr0FB_LongSpearGuy = $00FB	; Init Bank07:2068; Main Bank07:2137 | Long Spear Guy: stabs spear forward on a stab-cycle timer; Long variant uses DATA_079261 length pattern. Shares Main with Short Spear Guy; 3-state (walk / throw / recover); collides damage when stab-extended. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
