!Define_YI_NorSpr0FD_ZeusGuy = $00FD	; Init Bank07:9768; Main Bank07:9782 | Masked ceiling/floor hopper that fires a tracking lightning blast. Init clears state, installs DATA_07D08D timing table. Main has 7 states (walk / wind-up / fire-blast / recover / hit-variants) and dispatches a parallel animation pointer table; spawns the Zeus Guy Blast ($0FE) projectile. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
