!Define_YI_NorSpr0FF_Poochy = $00FF	; Init Bank07:2826; Main Bank07:2846 | Rideable dog that lets Yoshi cross lava/spikes. Path-following physics with rider-attachment offsets; single-instance gate via PoochyExistsFlag. ~1200-line Main handles tail-wag anim, step sounds, jump physics, and the "Yoshi rides on top" offset chain. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr100_Bubbled1up = $0100	; Init Bank04:9034; Main Bank04:9040 | Bubbled 1-up: bobs in place via $75E2 oscillation; pops on egg/sprite hit or stomp - spawns ambient pop puff $1E4 and awards 1-up score ($03A4A2 or 3up via CODE_spawn_3up_score when bonking from below). 1up-vs-3up gate uses $03A3 (tens digit of star counter): at 30+ stars, the winged-cloud spawner pre-stamps $18,x=$0002, which Main reads to give a 3-up -- unique scaling reward (powerup that scales based on current state at spawn time). See docs/family-collectibles.md.
