!Define_YI_NorSpr105_BooGuysCarryingBombToLeft = $0105	; Init Bank0D:482; Main Bank0D:671 | Boo Guys carrying bomb (leftward): Init stores direction=0 in $7400, claims a slot in the $0EEF pair table, allocates chain-rope data at $0EF7+, runs FXCODE_0ACE2F to probe rope length to ceiling, applies tileset-6/$0E Y nudge. Shares 3-state main_boo_guys_carrying_bombs (DATA_0D84A5) with $106. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
