!Define_YI_NorSpr108_Milde = $0108	; Init Bank04:9989; Main Bank04:10010 | Milde ($108): walking pink ghost (W3 castle level enemy, NOT the boss-Milde family $0D2-$0D4); 2-state machine (walk-bounce / eat-Yoshi cutscene); state 1 cinematic gulps player and spits him back via ambient pop $1EE. See docs/family-misc.md.
