!Define_YI_NorSpr10C_ChainedSpikeBall = $010C	; Init Bank0D:1333; Main Bank0D:1447 | Chained spike ball: Init runs slot-leader logic via $0FB7/$0FB9, recursively spawns $010D chain-segment children counted in $0FBB, queries FXCODE_0ACDFA for ceiling distance, lays out segments and renders spike-head at chain tip. Main runs chain physics; frees $0FB7 on full despawn. See docs/family-spikes.md.
