!Define_YI_NorSpr110_Flower = $0110	; Init Bank0E:6825; Main Bank0E:6843 | Flower (OAM-tilemap-rendered variant of $0FA -- render-only split, identical pickup behavior). Init just opens petals; 4-state main animates a 9-frame bloom cycle ($7402 walking from 0->9 then back via state 3) before falling through to shared CODE_0EB525 collect routine (uses same FlowersCollectedLo counter). CODE_pop_flower picks between $0FA and $0110 at 50/50 random; cloud-popped flowers are random variant. See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr111_GeorgetteJelly = $0111	; Init Bank01:3948; Main Bank01:3972 | Georgette Jelly: World 6 wobbling slime (reformable). Init self-pairs via $701900/$701902. Main runs freeze-aware SuperFX damage scan + egg/bounce/mount, dispatches 6 states via DATA_01A5E0, picks OAM size by $76. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr112_GeorgetteJellyGoo = $0112	; Init Bank01:4578; Main Bank01:4584 | Georgette Jelly Goo: droplets spat off Georgette Jelly. Init is a bare RTL. Main 2-state via $76: state 0 INC $76; state 1 arms drag + anim timer, advances anim frame, and despawns on ground-hit via CODE_03A31E. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr113_Snifit = $0113	; Init Bank07:2549; Main Bank07:2567 | Bubble-firing Shy Guy that walks a fixed patrol and shoots bubble snorts. 2-state (roaming / shooting); shoot phase spawns the Snifit Bullet ($114), an Explosion sound, and snort flash ambient sprite $1F5/$1F6 on the firing frame. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr114_SnifitBullet = $0114	; Init Bank07:2757; Main Bank07:2772 | Snifit bubble projectile. Linear travel using DATA_07958D X-speed pair; damages Yoshi on contact, despawns when off-screen. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr115_Coin = $0115	; Init Bank04:9137; Main Bank04:9149 | Coin: standard collectible; init seeds $7A96/$7A98/$7AF6 lifetime; main awards coin via $03B353 + spawns sparkle ambient $1E4 on player touch, can be head-bonked from below for upward throw. CODE_03B353 is PALETTE-BIT-driven (tests $7042,x & $0002 for yellow vs red) -- so a regular Coin $0115 with red palette bit set is effectively a red coin; the dedicated RedCoin $0065 exists only for static-placed red coins that need item-memory + hidden-item logic. See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr116_BuoyantRoundPlatform = $0116	; Init Bank04:6405; Main Bank04:6425 | Buoyant round platform: floats on water surface; Yoshi weight tips it via $7A38 angle accumulator; bobs from DATA_04AFBC velocities; uses CODE_04AEDF freeze gate + CODE_04AF4D pivot transform. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr117_DonutLift = $0117	; Init Bank04:9369; Main Bank04:9397 | Donut lift (small, 8-wide): wobbles when stood on, then falls; respawn cooldown via $7A96; rewrites 4 Map16 tiles from DATA_04CB5E via CODE_change_map16 when falling. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr118_LargeDonutLift = $0118	; Init Bank04:9370; Main Bank04:9398 | Large Donut lift (16-wide): same behaviour as $117 but uses 4-tile-wide Map16 footprint and DATA_04CB5E[5..] alternate tile IDs; same wobble-then-fall + respawn pattern. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr119_Spooky = $0119	; Init Bank05:13902; Main Bank05:13924 | Spooky group (revolving ghost faces). 5-state revolve-idle/pause/charge-swap/split-reform; uses ghost-mask phase rotation; reacts to player passing through with $6150 phase check. Panic-trigger sample is SoundID75_LitterMouserSqueak (also used by Sparrow flight + Little Mouser bell). See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr11A_GreenGlove = $011A	; Init Bank07:4029; Main Bank07:4045 | Egg-juggling Shy Guy. Walks/turn-around patrol; intercepts incoming eggs and launches them back as return projectiles. 5-state (walk / catch / hold / throw / look-up); catch grabs egg slot, throw mirrors Slugger's deflect pattern. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr11B_Lakitu = $011B	; Init Bank07:4826; Main Bank07:4893 | Standard cloud-riding Lakitu that throws Spiny Eggs at Yoshi. Init enforces single-instance via LakituActiveFlag; Main hovers within bounds, pursues Yoshi with capped X/Y velocity, spawns puff ambient $1F8 every 8 frames, and on stomp spawns the falling-Lakitu ($011C) cleanup sprite. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr11C_LakituCloud = $011C	; Init Bank0D:7881; Main Bank0D:7898 | Lakitu Cloud (the empty cloud left after defeating Lakitu): Init sets lifetime $7A96=$0360 and $7AF6=$0480 anim timer. Main lets Yoshi ride: if mounted ($61B6 matches X), cloud drifts per stick via DATA_0DBD48, clamps to screen and despawns on timer-out or dismount. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr11D_SpinyEgg = $011D	; Init Bank0E:6329; Main Bank0E:6342 | Spiny Egg (alternate ID): second-spawn variant of $099. Shares family init (RTL) + main_needlenose_family with $099/$0E5/$0F9. Differs only in sprite-ID branch table inside CODE_0EB1D4 (no special-case effect for $11D, falls into general $1DF ambient-spawn). Used by other handlers to spawn a 2nd Spiny Egg instance. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr11E_BrownArrowWheel = $011E	; Init Bank05:14722; Main Bank05:14742 | Brown Arrow Wheel (rotating ride). Init picks rotation step from DATA_05F07B (0x0480 for brown); Yoshi mounts and arrow buttons spin the wheel; shared Main with $11F. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr11F_BlueArrowWheel = $011F	; Init Bank05:14723; Main Bank05:14743 | Blue Arrow Wheel. Same rotating ride as $11E with a different angular step (0x0240, slower); shared Init+Main; arrow markers on rim drive direction. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr120_DoubledSidedArrowLift = $0120	; Init Bank05:15154; Main Bank05:15196 | Double-ended Arrow Lift. 2-state idle/travel-toward-target dispatch; oscillates between two arrow endpoints stamped into $7A36/$7A38; rideable platform that reverses on endpoint touch. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr121_NumberPlatformExplosion = $0121	; Init Bank04:9488; Main Bank04:9498 | Number-platform explosion FX: numbered floor-tile shatter; rewrites 4 Map16 tiles from DATA_04CC25 (tile pairs 7600/7601, 7775/7776, etc.) + spawns puff $1E6 + pop SFX, then despawns. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr122_BucketWithBandit = $0122	; Init Bank05:8977; Main Bank05:9015 | Bucket carried by Bandit. Shares Init with $021/$123; 5-state idle/knocked-swing/tip-contents/empty-rocking/settle dispatch from bucket_obj_state_ptr; spawns a Bandit on dispense. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr123_BucketWithCoins = $0123	; Init Bank05:8978; Main Bank05:9016 | Bucket carried by coins. Same 5-state bucket_obj dispatch as $122; ID offset selects coin payload instead of Bandit; tip phase showers coins via CODE_spawn_sprite calls. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr124_Stretch = $0124	; Init Bank04:2359; Main Bank04:2410 | Stretch: tall World 5-cave enemy with elastic neck; 7-state machine (walk / turn / extend-toward-Yoshi / pull-Yoshi / retract / fly-out-defeated / despawn); SuperFX dynamic-tile slot via $03AD74 for bend animation, can spit projectile sub-spawn. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr125_AttackingAndEndingKamek = $0125	; Init Bank03:12763; Main Bank03:12818 | Attacking/Ending Kamek (mid-level shell-grower + ending-cinematic flyer). Init disambiguates "chasing" vs "ending" variant from x-low-nibble, stashes in $701900, then JMPs (DATA_kamek_init_ptr) per-variant. Main JMPs (DATA_kamek_main_ptr) into a 9-entry ending-state-machine or the chasing body. See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr126_SpikedLogOnPulley = $0126	; Init Bank0D:2635; Main Bank0D:2731 | Spiked log on pulley: Init spawns paired $127 anchor, copies XY into it, queries FXCODE_0ACDFA for ceiling distance, hangs log at that length, caches counter in $701900. Main main_chained_pulley_log runs 4-state DATA_0D94ED (idle / descending / ascending / stomp-recoil). See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr127_PulleyOfSpikedLog = $0127	; Init Bank0D:3056; Main Bank0D:3066 | Pulley itself (chain anchor for $126): Init bare RTL. Main updates chain physics, watches partner $126's $7D36 stomp flag; on hit pulls log up (Y-speed $FFC0, decrements $701900 spring count). Plays $5A PulleySqueak; renders chain via FXCODE_088205. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr128_GroundRippleInBabyBowerRoom = $0128	; Init Bank0D:12167; Main Bank0D:12177 | Ground-ripple in Baby Bowser room: screen-shake/heat-distortion effect tied to giant-Bowser footsteps. Init bare RTL. Main animates wave via FXCODE_0B96EA + DATA_0DF04C, advances $78 amplitude (clamped $A00), runs FXCODE_099011 probe to push Yoshi/sprites on stomp impulses. See docs/family-bowserfight.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr129_Fuzzy = $0129	; Init Bank03:14921; Main Bank03:14937 | Fuzzy: floating black pollen that drift-up; if eaten causes the mosaic-intoxication effect. Init seeds Y-speed $FF40 (upward drift) and XSpeed from variant table DATA_03F57A. Main applies physics, swallow-handling (sets TouchedFuzzyMosaicTimer), and sine-wave-motion bookkeeping via $18,x anchor. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr12A_ShyGuyBanditTrap = $012A	; Init Bank04:1380; Main Bank04:1496 | Shy-Guy Bandit Trap: shares shyguy Main but Init preloads sub-state $76 = 5 (the "in-trap, dispense at touch" branch); on Yoshi-touch (sprite ID $87) triggers forced level-exit via $7E48 = FFFF. See docs/family-bandits.md. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr12B_FatGuy = $012B	; Init Bank07:5710; Main Bank07:5782 | Big bouncing Shy Guy. Init queries SuperFX for spawn-variant (small vs big); 4-state Main (walk / turn / fall / squashed). Bounces off other Fat Guys with bilateral X-velocity swap; egg-hit knocks back via the growth-sound path. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr12C_FlyOrWhirlyGuy = $012C	; Init Bank0C:14609; Main Bank0C:14698 | Fly Guy / Whirly Guy. Init has 2 variants from $701900: fly (cruise + Y-bob) or whirly (spin via $17 stepper). Carries coin overhead; drops $115 coin when stomped or hit by egg. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr12D_PrologueCutsceneYoshi = $012D	; Init Bank0C:15355; Main Bank0C:15375 | Yoshi sprite used only in the prologue cutscene. 8-state ptr (idx 1-7 collapse to same handler -- 7-fold redundancy in DATA_prologue_yoshi_state_ptr); $7042 OAM-prio bit set per index. Once player X >= $01C8, the leader slot pins itself as PlayerState04, copies position to EXRAM_YI_Player_XPosLo, JMLs CODE_03A31E to despawn -- player engine takes over from that exact pixel. See docs/family-cinematic.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr12E_LargePopEffect = $012E	; Init Bank06:6292; Main Bank06:6321 | Large Pop Effect: the POP particle burst spawned when something big breaks. Init is RTL. Main recenters Layer3 BG on camera, enables color-math, advances anim via DATA_06B940/06B946; despawns when state underflows. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr12F_HorizontalLavaDrop = $012F	; Init Bank07:5398; Main Bank07:5436 | Horizontal lava-drop blob that oscillates between two X endpoints derived from spawn position. Spawns lava-splash ambient sprite $1FA at each endpoint, reverses direction with a brief pause animation chain. See docs/family-hazards.md §4.
!Define_YI_NorSpr130_VerticalLavaDrop = $0130	; Init Bank07:5526; Main Bank07:5584 | Vertical lava-drop blob that oscillates between two Y endpoints, spawning vertical splash ambient $1FB at each end. Two visual variants via DATA_07ACCA/CE selected by direction; mirrors the horizontal version's bounce-pause loop. See docs/family-hazards.md §4.
!Define_YI_NorSpr131_LockedDoor = $0131	; Init Bank02:3487; Main Bank02:3749 | Locked Door variant 2: secondary locked-door slot. Init increments $7A36; if no key morphs to Door $093, else falls through to ClosedDoor Init. Shares Main with door family. See docs/family-misc.md §1.
!Define_YI_NorSpr132_LemonDrop = $0132	; Init Bank06:2461; Main Bank06:2495 | Lemon Drop (small yellow slime, W3 yellow-cliff caves): Init seeds state byte $76,x = $05 (fall phase) and RTL. Main dispatches 11-entry DATA_lemon_drop_state_ptr (form-up / drop / splat / despawn + post-bounce mirrors). See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr133_LanternGhost = $0133	; Init Bank04:1402; Main Bank04:1497 | Lantern Ghost: shares shyguy Init/Main with $01E - same 9-state machine, same OAM template; differs only in tile/palette decided in Main per sprite-ID branch. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr134_BabyBowser = $0134	; Init Bank0D:8862; Main Bank0D:8914 | BABY BOWSER (World 6 final boss). Init bare RTL  $08E Kamek sets state directly. Main runs a 39-entry DATA_baby_bowser_phase_ptrs at $76,x: $00-$12 small Bowser (intro/hop/chase), $13-$15 Kamek-transform, $16+ giant Bowser. Drives boss-life $0B83, spawns $0CF/$128/$0CE/$008/$0AC supports. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr135_CirclingRaven = $0135	; Init Bank0D:3159; Main Bank0D:3199 | Circling raven (variant A): Init zeros $7400, picks initial half-side from $70E2 bit $10 ($78,x=0 or 2), stores orbit-center XY-8 in $701900/$701902. Shares main_small_raven; angle $7A36 advances +$0100/frame from DATA_0D98C6. Stompable, damages on contact. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr136_CirclingRaven = $0136	; Init Bank0D:3160; Main Bank0D:3200 | Circling raven (variant B): same Init path; ID mismatch branch sets $18,x=$0080 (counterclockwise/larger radius). Shared main_small_raven uses index ASL via (SpriteID - $135) to pick angular speed $0400 (faster vs $135's $0100) from DATA_0D98C6. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr137_3x6FallingStone = $0137	; Init Bank02:3140; Main Bank02:3175 | 3x6 Falling Stone (vertical): tall stone column. Shared init_falling_rock_common picks 3x6 hitbox via DATA_029E45[0]/DATA_029E4D[0]. Shared Main checks Map16 floor + drops/crumbles. See docs/family-hazards.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr138_3x3FallingStone = $0138	; Init Bank02:3141; Main Bank02:3176 | 3x3 Falling Stone (square): small cube variant. DATA_029E4D[1] picks 3x3 hitbox. Same Init/Main as $137 family -- gravity drop, Yoshi-crush, floor crumble. See docs/family-hazards.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr139_3x9FallingStone = $0139	; Init Bank02:3142; Main Bank02:3177 | 3x9 Falling Stone (tall column): tallest variant. DATA_029E4D[2] picks 3x9 hitbox. Same Init/Main as the falling-stone family. See docs/family-hazards.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr13A_6x3FallingStone = $013A	; Init Bank02:3143; Main Bank02:3178 | 6x3 Falling Stone (wide slab): horizontal slab. DATA_029E4D[3] picks 6x3 hitbox. Same Init/Main as the falling-stone family. See docs/family-hazards.md §5.
!Define_YI_NorSpr13B_StomachAcid = $013B	; Init Bank02:8822; Main Bank02:8829 | Stomach Acid: rising acid inside Prince Froggy $045. Init empty (parent seeds). Main hit-tests Yoshi (+-8 px), arms damage on contact, rises Y-vel $0100; on hit spawns ambient $221 splash + plays SoundID $45, despawns. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr13C_DownFlippers = $013C	; Init Bank0D:3422; Main Bank0D:3435 | Pinball down-flippers: Init zeros $7400, runs CODE_0D9C93 shared platform setup. Main draws via FXCODE_0B8595, snaps to OAM tile $04B4/$0474 (rest/active), on head-bop ($7D36) sets $18,x=2 hit timer, raises Yoshi out, plays $0E ShellHit4. See docs/family-misc.md §8.
!Define_YI_NorSpr13D_DanglingFang = $013D	; Init Bank07:6022; Main Bank07:6030 | Cave bat that clings to the ceiling until Yoshi enters proximity, then drops. 3-state (cling / fall / land); cling state polls Yoshi distance, fall uses sine/cosine LUT for arc trajectory. See docs/family-misc.md §7.
!Define_YI_NorSpr13E_FlyingFang = $013E	; Init Bank07:6215; Main Bank07:6250 | Flying cave bat (spawned by Bat Generator). Reads spawn variant from low bit of X to pick descent arc DATA_07B1A6; auto-despawns off-screen and decrements SpawnedBatGeneratorBats counter. Drops on hit like dangling bat. See docs/family-misc.md §7.
!Define_YI_NorSpr13F_SwimmingFlopsyFish = $013F	; Init Bank07:6325; Main Bank07:6376 | Swimming Flopsy Fish: cruises horizontally underwater with oscillating Y-speed and direction-reversal at X bounds. 7-state shared engine with $140; in Lake Shore Paradise spawns 4 px lower. Damages Yoshi on contact; killed by stomp. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr140_SwimmingAndJumpingFlopsyFish = $0140	; Init Bank07:6326; Main Bank07:6391 | Swimming-and-Jumping Flopsy Fish: same swim Main as $13F plus a periodic surface-jump arc triggered by a random tick mask. Falls back into swim cycle after the arc completes. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr141_SwimmingAndArcJumpingFlopsyFish = $0141	; Init Bank05:15548; Main Bank05:15613 | Flopsy Fish (swimming+arc-jump variant). 4-state swim/arc-jump/airborne/stub dispatch; swims in water then arcs out toward Yoshi; X-speed from DATA_05F84C selected by spawn-side. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr142_3JumpFlopsyFish = $0142	; Init Bank05:15549; Main Bank05:15614 | Flopsy Fish (3-jump variant). Same Main as $141; performs a triple-jump pattern using $16,x repeat counter (init=3); leaves and re-enters water surface for each jump. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr143_SprayFish = $0143	; Init Bank07:7810; Main Bank07:7838 | Spray Fish (water spout enemy). 6-state (idle / wind-up / spray / pause / re-aim / despawn) where spray fires a column of ambient-water sprite $206 with thunder-cue sounds; aims at Yoshi when within range using SuperFX trig table DATA_07BEB4. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr144_RightOrLeftFlippers = $0144	; Init Bank0D:3813; Main Bank0D:3834 | Pinball L/R flippers: Init picks left or right from $70E2 bit $10 ($7A36 = $80 or -$80), runs shared platform setup. Main mirrors $13C logic but renders horizontally and uses OAM tile $04B5/$0475. Player can stand on them; head-bop response identical. See docs/family-misc.md §8.
!Define_YI_NorSpr145_BlueSluggy = $0145	; Init Bank07:6849; Main Bank07:6879 | Blue Sluggy (the pink/blue underwater slime variant, distinct from the boss). 4-state (idle / spit / chase / despawn): waits for Yoshi to approach, splashes onto land, chases, dies in single egg hit or stomp. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr146_PinkSluggy = $0146	; Init Bank07:6854; Main Bank07:6880 | Pink Sluggy: identical to Blue Sluggy ($145) -- shares Init/Main/StompRt with only spawn X-bound init constants reused; palette only differs at the sprite-table level. See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr147_HorizontalEntranceToLeft = $0147	; Init Bank02:9922; Main Bank02:9959 | Horizontal Entrance (leftward): left-facing pipe. Init pre-increments $18 by 2 (direction) then falls into right-variant Init for shared FXCODE_0ACE2F hitbox setup. Shared Main detects D-pad-left + Yoshi-on-mouth, warps. Writes $8004 to PipeTransitionType. See docs/family-pipes-signs.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr148_LargeSpringBall = $0148	; Init Bank05:482; Main Bank05:551 | Large Spring Ball variant -- shares Init + launch math with $06C (same $0100 zoom + #$000C bbox + same Y-velocity boost since $0E=$02 path skips the extra LSR damping that $06F=$0E=$00 takes). What makes $148 unique is a fall-through-from-above gate at Bank05:561-574: when $75E0 LSB=1 + $7860 LSB=0 + $75E0&$FFFE < y_pixel_pos, it clears $7040[$000C] (drops Yoshi's collision flag) so he can fall down through this variant. See docs/family-misc.md §11.
!Define_YI_NorSpr148_FallThroughSpringBall = $0148	; Friendly alias of $0148 (above). Same sprite ID; descriptive name captures the actual gameplay difference vs $06C (this variant lets Yoshi drop through under specific conditions, rather than being a "damped" or weaker launcher -- the launch math is identical to $06F/$06C). See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr149_UpArrowCloud = $0149	; Init Bank07:7206; Main Bank07:7290 | Up-pointing arrow cloud (egg redirector). Init loads direction-index $E into $18,x and falls through into shared cloud Init. Main catches a flying egg, redirects via DATA_07B97C/DATA_07B98C velocity vectors, spawns clank ambient $200 plus pitch-stepped clank sound. See docs/family-clouds.md.
