!Define_YI_NorSpr14B_RightArrowCloud = $014B	; Init Bank07:7215; Main Bank07:7292 | Right arrow cloud: direction-index $A; shares Main with $149 (egg-catch + redirect + clank). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr14C_DownRightArrowCloud = $014C	; Init Bank07:7219; Main Bank07:7293 | Down-right arrow cloud: direction-index $8; shares Main with $149. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr14D_DownArrowCloud = $014D	; Init Bank07:7223; Main Bank07:7294 | Down arrow cloud: direction-index $6; shares Main with $149. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr14E_DownLeftArrowCloud = $014E	; Init Bank07:7227; Main Bank07:7295 | Down-left arrow cloud: direction-index $4; shares Main with $149. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr14F_LeftArrowCloud = $014F	; Init Bank07:7231; Main Bank07:7296 | Left arrow cloud: direction-index $2; shares Main with $149. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr150_UpLeftArrowCloud = $0150	; Init Bank07:7235; Main Bank07:7297 | Up-left arrow cloud: direction-index $0; shares Main with $149. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr151_RotatingArrowCloud = $0151	; Init Bank07:7256; Main Bank07:7304 | Rotating arrow cloud: same redirect mechanic as the 8 fixed-direction clouds but the direction-index advances each frame (divided through hardware-multiplier registers) and ASL-stored to $18,x. Animation cycles a third of the speed via REGISTER_Divisor=3. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr152_Flutter = $0152	; Init Bank07:7408; Main Bank07:7440 | The big caterpillar-style enemy (Flutter). 3-state (fly / dive / cling-recover): hovers with sine bob, dive-bombs when Yoshi underneath, drops out into a stomp-bounce on top of Yoshi. Drops a winged shield when stomped via $60A8/$60AA spawn-vector. See docs/family-misc.md §13.
!Define_YI_NorSpr153_GoonieWithShyGuy = $0153	; Init Bank0E:2631; Main Bank0E:2751 | Goonie with Shy Guy: Goonie carrying a Shy Guy on its back. Init shared with $0E8/$0E9 (init_goonie_with_shyguy entry); on launch spawns a $01E Shy Guy passenger via CODE_03A366 linked through $78,x, then re-tags self as Goonie ($0E8). Shares 7-state goonie main; Shy Guy drops when Goonie is stomped. See docs/family-goonies.md and docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr154_SharkChomp = $0154	; Init Bank0D:4238; Main Bank0D:4293 | Shark Chomp: giant fish that lunges from the water. Init parks state=2 with hitbox $74A2=$FF until Yoshi-X is close, then configures Layer-3 framing ($MainScreenLayers=$15, $Layer3X/Y seeded), $701900=$0400, $701902=-$18. Main runs 7-state DATA_0DA0F0 (lurk/surface/lunge/chomp/sink). See docs/family-fish.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr155_FatGoonie = $0155	; Init Bank0E:3438; Main Bank0E:3525 | Fat Goonie: oversized Goonie variant. 11-state ptr table (perch/drop-shy-guy/fly/dive cycle with entries 4-6 aliased into 1-3 for bowling variant entry). Init validates spawn distance (off-screen rejection at >$0120 dx) then sets bigger hitbox + flight pattern. Shared with $158 Bowling Goonie main. See docs/family-goonies.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr156_CactusJack = $0156	; Init Bank0E:7216; Main Bank0E:7344 | Cactus Jack: tall stationary cactus enemy that lobs spike-balls. Init probes terrain via SuperFX FXCODE_0ACE2F to find ground anchor; 8-state ptr table runs lob attack cycle. Spawns spike-ball $0EC858 projectile on attack; head-bop transitions state to $03 (knocked down) via $7AF6 timer. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr157_WallLakitu = $0157	; Init Bank07:8305; Main Bank07:8357 | Wall Lakitu that emerges from a hole and throws projectile sprite $11D. Multi-state nested dispatch (peek / launch) with sub-states (hide / wait / appear / aim / throw); SuperFX-aimed projectile spawn at $07C632 calls FXCODE_09907C for trajectory. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr158_BowlingGoonie = $0158	; Init Bank0E:3447; Main Bank0E:3526 | Bowling Goonie: Goonie carrying a Bowling Ball as a bowling pin. Shares init body with $155 Fat Goonie but enters at the "$158" entry that sets initial state $76=$0A (carry-and-drop posture) + spawns ball via $74A2 link. Shares 11-state main_fat_goonie with $155; drops ball when flying over player, ball becomes Chomp Rock-style hazard. See docs/family-goonies.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr159_WalkingGrunt = $0159	; Init Bank07:8766; Main Bank07:8805 | Walking Grunt (red+yellow spike-hat Shy Guy). 5-state (walk / turn / jump-prep / jump / land); ledge-walks, jumps off when blocked. On egg-hit Y-jumps backward spawning explosion ambient $207; stomp kills. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr15A_RunningGrunt = $015A	; Init Bank07:8787; Main Bank07:8819 | Running Grunt (faster spike-hat variant): faster X-speed ($0100 vs walking's $0060) and 2-frame run cycle; shares the turn/jump/land states with $159. Re-uses walking state-table layout but with run anim frames DATA_07C73F. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr15B_DancingSpearGuy = $015B	; Init Bank07:9127; Main Bank07:9177 | Dancing Spear Guy: dual-mode enemy. With conductor sprite present (level controller $0C50) runs a 9-step dance/throw choreography in sync with the conductor's beat. Without conductor, follows a similar 9-state independent solo state machine. See docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr15C_GreenRotatingPlatformSwitch = $015C	; Init Bank0D:4813; Main Bank0D:4832 | Green rotating-platform switch: Init derives $78=(SpriteID-$15C)*2=0, caches Y in $701902. Shares main_spiked_platform_switch; egg hit toggles $0FD1[$78] vs $0FD5[$78] which paired $15F/$160 platforms read to swap rotation. Stomp recoil clamps own Y back. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr15D_RedRotatingPlatformSwitch = $015D	; Init Bank0D:4814; Main Bank0D:4833 | Red rotating-platform switch: same Init/Main as $15C but $78 = 2 (selects red pair). Toggles a different rotating spike-platform pair via $0FD1/$0FD5 + 2. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr15E_4PinkRotatingPlatformsWithShyGuys = $015E	; Init Bank04:8214; Main Bank04:8305 | 4 pink rotating platforms with shy-guy riders: spawns 4 shyguy passengers (sprite $1E) on the 4 corners via $0FF9-$1009 corner-offset table; cluster auto-rotates like $064 with riders piggybacked. See docs/family-platforms.md and docs/family-shyguys.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr15F_GreenSpikedPlatform = $015F	; Init Bank0D:4865; Main Bank0D:4914 | Green spiked platform (paired with switch $15C): Init derives pair-index $78=0, claims slot via $0FC1 (skips if filled), spawns companion via stored $7722, increments active-count $0FCD, sets hitbox $7BB6=$19/$7BB8=$07. Shares main_spiked_platform  rotates around switch-bound axis. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr160_RedSpikedPlatform = $0160	; Init Bank0D:4866; Main Bank0D:4915 | Red spiked platform (controlled by $15D): same shared Init/Main as $15F but $78 = 2 selects the red rotation pair. Pair of spiked platforms rotate as a unit around the switch axis. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr161_RewardItemForDefeatingRoomEnemies = $0161	; Init Bank0F:2573; Main Bank0F:2602 | Reward item for "defeat-all-enemies" bonus rooms. Init packs (X,Y) tile coordinates into GenericTable701900. Main runs FXCODE_09AF4A descent FX; on landing spawns one of 4 items (Coin/Key/Flower/Door, DATA_0F92D9). See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr162_DoubleSpikePlatformWithSwitch = $0162	; Init Bank0D:5265; Main Bank0D:5290 | Double spiked platform with switch: one sprite manages switch + 2 platforms together. Init runs CODE_03AE60/03AD74, caches angle in $701902, clears $701900/$7400, sets $7BB8=$08. Main drives a 4-helper pipeline: 3-part OAM render (sub-offsets $40/$20/$60), rotate, hit-detect, switch anim. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr163_BouncingNeedlenose = $0163	; Init Bank0F:2354; Main Bank0F:2368 | Bouncing Green Needlenose (hopping spike enemy). Init = bare RTL. Main: CODE_03AF23 + on-ground test ($6FA2 low bits); on land applies hop Y-vel from DATA_0F9112, plays SoundID13; $18,x caps hops at 2. See docs/family-spikes.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr164_NipperPlant = $0164	; Init Bank0F:1594; Main Bank0F:1637 | Nipper Plant (rooted enemy that spits spores). Init sets stationary kinematics (gravity $0040, anim timer $0020). Main: 4-state machine via DATA_0F8BB8 (idle / spit / blow-out / turn); spit substate spawns sprite $165. See docs/family-piranhas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr165_NipperSpore = $0165	; Init Bank0F:1566; Main Bank0F:1621 | Nipper Spore (projectile spat by Nipper Plant). Init sets X-vel from DATA_0F8B32 by X-parity. Main: on ground-collide ($CurrentStatus==$0008) spawns + inits a new Nipper Plant ($164) in place -- "spore germinates". See docs/family-piranhas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr166_ThunderLakitu = $0166	; Init Bank07:13264; Main Bank07:13306 | Thunder Lakitu: cloud-riding miniboss that hovers, charges, then strikes with chained thunder ambient sprites. 4-state Main (cruise / charge / strike / recover). Spawns a paired off-screen partner Lakitu; stomp triggers 3-state fall-respawn cycle ($11C cleanup sprite + reposition). See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr167_GreenKoopaShell = $0167	; Init Bank07:11061; Main Bank07:11076 | Green Koopa Shell (kicked/idle). Becomes projectile on Yoshi tongue-spit or kick; bounces off walls with ascending shell-impact sound chain DATA_07DA9C; breaks Map16 blocks at impact corner via CODE_change_map16. Wakes back into a Naked Koopa after timer. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr168_RedKoopaShell = $0168	; Init Bank07:11062; Main Bank07:11077 | Red Koopa Shell: same Main as $167 with red palette and slightly different shell-wake behavior; in V1.1 layer-priority bits forced via OAM mask. Identical kick/bounce/break-block mechanics. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr169_GreenNakedKoopa = $0169	; Init Bank07:11571; Main Bank07:11614 | Green Naked Koopa: post-stomp shelled Koopa. Walks with edge-stop check using SuperFX FXCODE_08949D ground probe; 4-state (walk / turn / on-shell-pickup / squashed). Stomp converts back to shell-out state. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr16A_RedNakedKoopa = $016A	; Init Bank07:11572; Main Bank07:11615 | Red Naked Koopa: same 4-state Main as $169 with red palette and slightly different behavior; uses identical SuperFX ground probe; shares pickup/stomp handlers with $169. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr16B_GreenKoopa = $016B	; Init Bank07:11592; Main Bank07:11643 | Green Koopa (shelled). Walks with SuperFX ground probe; 3-state (walk / turn / panic). On stomp drops to its Naked Koopa form ($169) AND spawns a free Green Koopa Shell ($167) using DATA_07E3DB launch vector. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr16C_RedKoopa = $016C	; Init Bank07:11593; Main Bank07:11644 | Red Koopa (shelled): same behavior pattern as $16B but drops Red shell ($168) + Red Naked Koopa ($16A) on stomp; otherwise identical Main. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr16D_GreenParakoopa = $016D	; Init Bank07:12446; Main Bank07:12550 | Green Parakoopa: hopping winged Koopa, infinite small bounces. 2-state (hop / stomped). On stomp triggers a single jump-up animation, then falls through into the underlying Green Koopa ($16B); SuperFX FXCODE_08949D ground probe each frame. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr16E_RedHorizontalParakoopa = $016E	; Init Bank07:12486; Main Bank07:12616 | Red horizontal Parakoopa: flies back-and-forth horizontally between X bounds set in Init; 8-frame wing-flap. On stomp converts to underlying Red Koopa ($16C); ground-probe and turnaround logic same as $16D. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr16F_RedVerticalParakoopa = $016F	; Init Bank07:12522; Main Bank07:12672 | Red vertical Parakoopa: flies up-and-down between Y bounds; same wing-flap anim as $16E but vertical pendulum. On stomp converts to underlying Red Koopa ($16C); uses DATA_07E593 for direction-paired pause timer. See docs/family-koopas.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr170_AquaLakitu = $0170	; Init Bank07:12842; Main Bank07:12865 | Aqua Lakitu: underwater Lakitu that swims along a sinusoidal path firing tracking Bullet Bills ($0099) at Yoshi. 3-state (cruise / throw / pause); cruise uses SuperFX FXCODE_0ACE2F bottom-probe to detect water-tile boundary and reverse swim; throw spawns paired bubble ambients $201/$1BA on key frames. See docs/family-clouds.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr171_NavalPiranha = $0171	; Init Bank02:11227; Main Bank02:11302 | Naval Piranha: World 3-8 castle boss. Init sets boss slot $1072, HP=3 ($1082, cart $02:E4B5 tweak), spawns Piranha Plant $066. Main dispatches 38-entry DATA_naval_pir_state_ptr; states $02-$0B lunge, $0F-$15 lateral, $17+ death. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr172_NavalPiranhaBuds = $0172	; Init Bank02:13046; Main Bank02:13061 | Naval Piranha Buds: smaller piranhas snaking from floor during boss. Init empty (parent bakes state). Main copies anim byte from parent ($1072) each frame, dispatches 18-entry DATA_naval_pir_bud_state_ptr. See docs/bossengine.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr173_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingShyGuy = $0173	; Init Bank07:14035; Main Bank07:14174 | Baron Von Zeppelin carrying Shy Guy. Payload-type $00 -- BVZ balloon drifts in from edge using DATA_07F110 X-speed; when Yoshi attacks or balloon pops, releases a Shy Guy sprite at the carrier's offset. Shares main_bvz_simple Main with $174/$175/$176. See docs/family-shyguys.md. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr174_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingNeedlenose = $0174	; Init Bank07:14031; Main Bank07:14175 | BVZ carrying Needlenose: payload-type $02. Same simple-drop Main as $173 -- balloon drift + pop releases the cactus-needle enemy as the payload sprite. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr175_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingBomb = $0175	; Init Bank07:14027; Main Bank07:14176 | BVZ carrying Bomb: payload-type $04. Drops a Bomb sprite that explodes on landing; shares the simple-payload Main with $173/$174/$176. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr176_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingBandit = $0176	; Init Bank07:14023; Main Bank07:14177 | BVZ carrying Bandit: payload-type $06. Drops a Bandit (coin-thief Shy Guy variant) -- shares the simple-payload Main; otherwise identical to $173. See docs/family-bandits.md. See docs/family-shyguys.md. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr177_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingLargeSpringBall = $0177	; Init Bank07:13986; Main Bank07:14191 | BVZ carrying Large Spring Ball: payload-type $08. Init also loads a SuperFX glyph chunk (FXDATA_550000+$40E0) into VRAM via FXCODE_088293 for the spring-ball visual; drops the large bouncing spring ball. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr178_BaronVonZeppelinCarrying1up = $0178	; Init Bank07:13975; Main Bank07:14236 | BVZ carrying 1up: payload-type $0A. Uses Init shim CODE_07F28B to verify no duplicate 1up already collected. Main is the "swing payload" variant (main_bvz_swing_payload); release spawns a 1up Mushroom. See docs/family-bvz.md.
