!Define_YI_NorSpr17A_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingCoins = $017A	; Init Bank07:13965; Main Bank07:14238 | BVZ carrying Coins: payload-type $0E. Swing-payload Main; release shower-spawns coin sprites using DATA_bvz_payload_drop_ptr handler at CODE_07F9F9; plays CoinSpillage sound on pop. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr17B_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingWatermelon = $017B	; Init Bank07:14019; Main Bank07:14206 | BVZ carrying Watermelon: payload-type $10. Plain drop-payload Main (main_bvz_drop_payload); release drops a regular Watermelon Yoshi can eat to spit seeds. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr17C_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingFireWatermelon = $017C	; Init Bank07:14015; Main Bank07:14207 | BVZ carrying Fire Watermelon: payload-type $12. Same drop Main as $17B; release spawns a Fire Watermelon (lets Yoshi spit fire seeds). See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr17D_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingIcyWatermelon = $017D	; b? (Baron Von Zeppelin treasure variant) | BVZ carrying Icy Watermelon: payload-type $14. Main runs the icy-freeze tick (CODE_melon_icy_freeze_tick) each frame so the carried melon flashes; releases an Icy Watermelon. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr17E_BaronVonZeppelinCarryingCrateWith6Stars = $017E	; Init Bank07:14086; Main Bank07:14280 | BVZ carrying Crate-with-6-Stars: payload-type $16. Distinct Main main_bvz_crate_6_stars: loads SuperFX glyph chunk FXDATA_550000+$2080 and tracks 3 separate animation phase indices (the 6 stars). Drop releases all 6 stars to Yoshi's stock. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr17F_BaronVonZeppelin = $017F	; Init Bank07:15256; Main Bank07:15273 | The Baron Von Zeppelin balloon itself (no payload variant). 2-state Main (drift / drop-payload): drifts horizontally, monitors player X-position; when aligned drops a payload onto Yoshi's head (Yoshi-Y override) for damage. Killed by single egg hit or pop. See docs/family-bvz.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr180_SpinningLog = $0180	; Init Bank0D:7427; Main Bank0D:7446 | Spinning log (player platform): Init runs CODE_03AE60, zeros $7400, runs CODE_0DBA3D shared setup, sets contact width $7BB6=$0C. Main (main_spinning_log) runs 2-state DATA_0DBA22 (idle / spinning when stepped on). Yoshi rides the log; stepping rolls it forward and propels Yoshi opposite. See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr181_CrazeeDayzee = $0181	; Init Bank0F:452; Main Bank0F:486 | Crazee Dayzee (cheerful flower-headed walker). Init dedupes via GenericTable701900, seeds X-vel from DATA_0F835C frame-pair. Main: 3-state machine (walk/pivot/walk) via DATA_0F83C5. StompRt does head-bop dance + despawn. See docs/family-misc.md §3.
!Define_YI_NorSpr182_Dragonfly = $0182	; Init Bank0F:1374; Main Bank0F:1397 | Dragonfly (ambient airborne creature). Init sets anim timer + seeds 8-entry hover-pattern index from X bit-4 parity (DATA_0F89F5). Main hovers via figure-8 (DATA_0F89E5, 16-frame X-offset cycle), flips at apexes. See docs/family-misc.md §13.
!Define_YI_NorSpr183_Butterfly = $0183	; Init Bank0F:1474; Main Bank0F:1520 | Butterfly (ambient flutterer). Init picks one of 4 random starting subpatterns from $10 (DATA_0F8A7B), seeds X/Y/velocity via DATA_0F8A83-$0F8A8F lookups. Main flips facing + toggles Y-vel sign each timer expiry. See docs/family-misc.md §13.
