!Define_YI_NorSpr190_FallingIcicle = $0190	; Init Bank0C:68; Main Bank0C:86 | Falling Icicle: spawn zeros Y speed + flags $74A2=$FFFF (pre-fall). 4-state main (hang/wobble/fall/shatter); transitions to fall on Yoshi proximity (X+/-$60, Y+/-$20). Gravity via CODE_03AF23. See docs/family-hazards.md §6.
