!Define_YI_NorSpr199_DizzyDandy = $0199	; Init Bank0C:1196; Main Bank0C:1215 | Dizzy Dandy (spinning flower). Init parks position, sets anim rate $76=1. Main drives SuperFX spin via FXDATA_550000+$2041/$2061 per state with 5-state spin dispatch (sleep/wake/chase/dizzy/fall). See docs/family-misc.md.
