!Define_YI_NorSpr19D_SkeletonGoonie = $019D	; Init Bank0C:3678; Main Bank0C:3699 | Skeleton Goonie (winged): glides with constant X-speed from $7400 facing + Y-jitter from DATA_0C9BBC sine table. Spawns $215 wing-flap ambient on $7A98 timer. On stomp drops $216 feather + morphs into $19E. See docs/family-goonies.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr19E_WinglessSkeletonGoonie = $019E	; Init Bank0C:3866; Main Bank0C:3881 | Wingless Skeleton Goonie (after-stomp fall). 3-state main (walk/fall/despawn): walks until floor lost ($7860 bit-0), falls with X-speed from DATA_0C9CF9, then despawn-animates skeleton. See docs/family-goonies.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr19F_SkeletonGoonieCarryingBomb = $019F	; Init Bank0C:3947; Main Bank0C:4012 | Skeleton Goonie with Bomb: init spawns $060 Bomb sprite linked via $7A36. Main glides like $19D; if bomb taken/destroyed, morphs to plain $19D. Stomp drops bomb + spawns $19E wingless variant. See docs/family-goonies.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A0_DoubleFirebar = $01A0	; Init Bank0C:4262; Main Bank0C:4292 | Double Firebar / Firebar (shares init+main with $1A1). Init picks rotation direction from $70E2 bit-4 ($78=$FF00/$0100). Main calls SuperFX FXCODE_0896DF with DATA_0CA003 control words for radial arms. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A1_Firebar = $01A1	; Init Bank0C:4263; Main Bank0C:4293 | Single Firebar (same handlers as $1A0 at $0CA00F / $0CA03C). Arm count/length encoded in spawn extra fields + DATA_0CA003. See $1A0 entry for behavior. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A2_HealthStar = $01A2	; Init Bank0C:7039; Main Bank0C:7052 | Health/Energy Star (Super-Star pickup). Main flashes via $74A2 + advances $7402 anim based on Y-speed banding; on floor-touch stops + bounces; on Yoshi pickup spawns $1EF starburst + grants 10 stars via $0396. See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A3_LittleSkullMouser = $01A3	; Init Bank0C:6775; Main Bank0C:6835 | Little Skull Mouser: walks like Goomba but invulnerable on top + damages Yoshi via $03A590. 2-state main (active/despawn); leap on $76 timer with squeak $75. On stomp bounces, on egg morphs into $030. See docs/family-misc.md §4.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A4_KeyholeCork = $01A4	; Init Bank07:15622; Main Bank07:15645 | Fort/castle Keyhole Cork. Init snaps to 8-px grid, verifies host BG tile is the keyhole tile via CODE_03D3F8. Main waits for Yoshi to push it carrying the Key sprite ($027); on success despawns the key, plays OpenDoor sound, advances 4-step cork-pop animation, then triggers level-clear. See docs/family-misc.md §14.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A5_RunAwayMonkey = $01A5	; Init Bank02:4998; Main Bank02:5216 | Run-Away Monkey (Grinder): grinder that flees Yoshi. Init JSRs CODE_02AE77 arg $02, picks left/right escape side ($7400), X-offset from DATA_02AD8C. Shares Main with 5-grinder family. See docs/family-misc.md §6.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A6_MonkeyWithWatermelon = $01A6	; Init Bank02:5061; Main Bank02:5217 | Monkey with Watermelon: grinder that spits seed/melon projectiles. Init JSRs CODE_02AE77 arg $04 then CODE_02AEA0 to spawn watermelon $007 ammo. Shared Main runs spit/run cycle. See docs/family-misc.md §6.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A7_HangingMonkeyThrowingBombsOrNeedlenoses = $01A7	; Init Bank02:5092; Main Bank02:5218 | Hanging Monkey Throwing Bombs/Needlenoses: hanging grinder dropping projectiles. Init JSRs CODE_02AE77 arg $06, picks player side, reuses DATA_02AD8C horizontal offset. Variant ammo per spawner. See docs/family-misc.md §6.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A8_TheifMonkey = $01A8	; Init Bank02:5128; Main Bank02:5219 | Thief Monkey: grinder that steals Baby Mario on contact. Init JSRs CODE_02AE77 arg $08 (no extra setup). Shared Main runs the snatch-Baby-Mario cinematic on Yoshi contact. See docs/family-misc.md §6.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1A9_HangingMonkeySpittingSeeds = $01A9	; Init Bank02:5076; Main Bank02:5220 | Hanging Monkey Spitting Seeds (climbing): climbing grinder variant. Init JSRs CODE_02AE77 arg $0A, clears priority, sets climbing-frame bits, XORs direction, then falls into shared spit-seed spawner CODE_02ADFD. See docs/family-misc.md §6.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1AA_HotLips = $01AA	; Init Bank0C:7540; Main Bank0C:7591 | Hot Lips (squashable lava lips). Init seeds anim phase; main calls SuperFX FXCODE_089822 with embedded sprite list DATA_0CB944 + offset table DATA_0CB9E4 to draw lips. Dispatches by $76 phase ptr. See docs/family-hazards.md §2.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1AB_BooBalloon = $01AB	; Init Bank0C:8126; Main Bank0C:8160 | Boo Balloon: floating boo in balloon. 4-state main (intact/popping/shrinking/despawn) + 3 drift sub-states (free/approach/pursuit); on pop spawns Shy Guy / Milde / Flying Fang via DATA_0CC83C. See docs/family-boos.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1AC_SmallFrog = $01AC	; Init Bank0F:2418; Main Bank0F:2434 | Small Frog enemy. Init seeds 1-of-4 palette subpatterns from $10 (DATA_0F9174). Main: 4-state machine (idle/jump-prep/leap/land) via DATA_0F9197; jumps when |player-X|<$30 AND |player-Y|<$30 proximity trigger. See docs/family-misc.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1AD_MagicShootingKamek = $01AD	; Init Bank0C:8760; Main Bank0C:8789 | Magic-Shooting Kamek. 6-state ptr (target/appear/cast/shoot/vanish/despawn) firing magic-shot $1AE in a 6-shot sequence (DATA_0CC466). Random screen-X via FXCODE_0AE921; head-bop is a no-op (immortal). See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1AE_MagicShot = $01AE	; Init Bank0C:9290; Main Bank0C:9300 | Magic Shot (projectile from Kamek $1AD). 2-state main (travel / explode): on spawn computes velocity to Yoshi via FXCODE_09907C; on hitting valid Map16 transforms tile + spawns Flying Fang / Milde / Shy Guy. See docs/family-kamek.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1AF_FloatingCoin = $01AF	; Init Bank0C:13450; Main Bank0C:13479 | Floating Coin: passive collectible. Main animates via timer $14, watches $7D36 for collision with player or egg/seed in range $022-$02B/$107; spawns $1E4 sparkle ambient + plays sound $09. See docs/family-collectibles.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B0_DeflatingBalloon = $01B0	; Init Bank0C:13680; Main Bank0C:13763 | **Inflating** BG3 balloon (basket pump partner of $073). The "Deflating" sprite-name is the opposite of what the code does -- Init/Main drive an inflating parametric shape via FXCODE_0A8390 (never deflates). Init sets BG3-CGRAM palette + HDMA scroll; main runs per-world dispatch; 4-state (inflate/drift/pop/cleanup). See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B0_InflatingBG3Balloon = $01B0	; Friendly alias of $01B0 (above). Same sprite ID; descriptive name corrects the "Deflating" template, which inverts the actual behavior (sprite inflates, not deflates). See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B1_CoinCannon = $01B1	; Init Bank11:5345; Main Bank11:5410 | Coin Cannon (gather-coins mini-battle spawner). Init sets center pos (X=$70,Y=$38), seeds X-speed from DATA_11B084 to ride a track left/right, primes SuperFX cannon render via FXCODE_0884A5. Main rotates the cannon then fires $1B2 coin pickups along a sine/cosine arc. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B2_MinigameCoin = $01B2	; Init Bank11:5542; Main Bank11:5559 | Mini-battle coin (pickup spawned by $1B1 cannon). Init seeds facing-direction byte $7400 from XSpeed sign. Main handles Yoshi-collect (BCD-increments $10EA coin counter, sound $09), bandit-collect, ceiling bounce (sound $2C), and ground rest. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B3_GatherCoinsBandit = $01B3	; Init Bank11:5663; Main Bank11:5676 | Gather-coins bandit (race-Yoshi-for-coins mini-battle). Init centers at (X=$C0,Y=$C0) with frame $09. Main runs a 5-state machine (DATA_11B381): scout via SuperFX FXCODE_098DDA, chase coin, grab, retreat  competing with Yoshi to grab cannon-fired coins. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B4_MinigameCheckeredPlatform = $01B4	; Init Bank11:3375; Main Bank11:3444 | Checkered platform (mini-battle "Watch out below!" room). Init pulls per-slot X/Y from DATA_11A0B2/DATA_11A0CA via slot counter $10FE, alternates left/right X-speed via $113C, stamps OAM index into $1100,y. Main bounces between $10-$50 (top row) or $90-$D0 (bottom row). See docs/family-platforms.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B5_PoppingBalloonsBandit = $01B5	; Init Bank11:4244; Main Bank11:4257 | Popping-balloons bandit ($1B6 companion). Init centers at (X=$C0,Y=$C0), frame $09, stores slot in $112E. Main runs a 5-state vector table (DATA_11A80A) for chasing/popping the red balloons; on win flag $10F4 freezes motion and resets to idle frame. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B6_MinigameBalloon = $01B6	; Init Bank11:3412; Main Bank11:3502 | Mini-battle red balloon (pop-the-balloons room). Init pulls slot X/Y from same DATA_11A0B2/DATA_11A0CA table as $1B4, advances $10FE, caches first-two slots into $1100/$1102. Main runs an 11-entry state dispatch (DATA_11A193) for bob/pop/score animation. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B7_SeedSpittingMinigameBandit = $01B7	; Init Bank11:6521; Main Bank11:6554 | Seed-spitting mini-battle bandit. Init centers at (X=$C0,Y=$C0), arms a 4-tick action timer at $7A96. Main runs SuperFX FXCODE_0ACE2F render and dispatches through duck/spit/recoil per the $701978 sub-state with DATA_11BAF0/DATA_11BAFE pose pickers. See docs/family-bandits.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B8_WatermelonPot = $01B8	; Init Bank11:7665; Main Bank11:7679 | Watermelon pot (seed source for seed-spit mini-battles). Init seeds $7A96 timer from H-counter + frame ($10) for jittered firing. Main 3-state dispatch (DATA_11C46C): countdown idle, then on $1110/$10FE conditions ejects watermelon seeds toward the bandit. See docs/family-bonusgame.md.
!Define_YI_NorSpr1B9_P2SeedSpittingMinigameBandit = $01B9	; Init Bank11:7888; Main Bank11:7917 | Two-player seed-spit bandit (phase-2 variant of $1B7). Init centers at (X=$C0,Y=$C0), arms $7A96 action timer at 4, also primes $7042 hit-stun timer to $30 (the faster/harder counterpart). Main shares the $1B7 spit/dodge logic with tighter timing. See docs/family-bandits.md.
